const RAW_U09_U24={"U09":[["bang","砰然一聲；猛敲；巨響","with a bang 砰然一聲；with a bang = 轟轟烈烈地；go off with a bang 圓滿成功；bang one's head 撞到頭","The police officer heard a loud bang and quickly grabbed his gun.","警察聽到一聲巨響，迅速拔出槍來。"],["quote","引述；引文","quote sb as saying... 引述某人說……；quotation n. 引文；quote/unquote 引號內／所謂的","The newspaper quoted the mayor as saying, ‘Two more parks will be built in this city next year.’","報紙引述市長的話：「明年這個城市將再蓋兩座公園。」"],["raw","生的；未加工的","eat sth raw 生吃某物；raw material 原料；uncooked a. 未煮熟的；unprocessed a. 未加工的","Some vegetables can be eaten raw.","有些蔬菜可以生吃。"],["freeze","結冰；凍僵；使凍結","freeze, froze, frozen；freeze to death 凍死；freezer n. 冷凍庫；freezing a. 冰冷的；freezing point 冰點；frozen a. 冰凍的；be frozen with fear 嚇呆","The water froze on the road, making it dangerous to drive.","水在路面結冰，使得開車很危險。"],["freezer","冷凍庫","—","Put the beef in the freezer.","把牛肉放進冷凍庫。"],["freezing","冰冷的；嚴寒的","a freezing cold day 嚴寒的一天；freezing point 冰點","The freezing weather closed the bridge and kept most people indoors.","嚴寒的天氣使橋梁封閉，也讓大多數人待在室內。"],["frozen","冰凍的；凍僵的","be frozen with fear 嚇呆","Mom took the frozen fish from the freezer, so I would defrost it.","媽媽從冷凍庫拿出冷凍魚，所以我要把它解凍。"],["request","要求；請求","at sb's request 應某人的要求；on request 應要求；for the asking 只要開口；require vt. 要求；requirement n. 要求","My boss thought my report was too lengthy, so I had to cut it short at his request.","老闆認為我的報告太冗長，所以我應他的要求縮短內容。"],["mental","心理的；精神的","mentally adv. 心理上地；psychological a. 心理的；physical a. 身體的；physical examination 身體檢查；physical education 體育","Lucy is said to have some mental problems. She is a little bit weird.","據說露西有些心理問題，她有點怪怪的。"],["victim","受害者","fall victim to... 成為……的受害者；fall prey to... 成為……的獵物／受害者；discriminate against... 歧視……；discrimination n. 歧視","Many teenagers fall victim to drugs.","許多青少年成為毒品的受害者。"],["republic","共和國","republican a. 共和國的；Republican Party（美）共和黨；the Democratic Party 民主黨；democratic a. 民主的","90% stands for the Republic of Korea, more commonly known as South Korea.","ROK 代表大韓民國，也就是一般所稱的南韓。"],["opposite","相反的；對面的；相反的人／事物；在……對面","hold the opposite view 持相反觀點；quite the opposite 正好相反；opposition n. 反對；oppose vt. 反對；be opposed to + N/V-ing 反對……","I live next to the bank opposite the train station.","我住在火車站對面的銀行旁邊。"],["superior","較優秀的；上級的；上司","be superior/inferior to... 優於／劣於……；one's superior/inferior 某人的上司／下屬；senior/junior to...；older/younger than...；inferior a. 較差的；劣等的","This car is far superior to that one in terms of comfort.","就舒適度而言，這輛車遠優於那輛車。"],["inferior","較差的；下級的","be inferior to... 劣於……","Confucius once said, ‘Do not make friends with those who are inferior to us.’","孔子曾說：「毋友不如己者。」"],["emergency","緊急事件","in case of emergency 萬一發生緊急事故","In Taiwan, in case of emergency, please dial 119.","在臺灣，如遇緊急事故，請撥 119。"],["emergency room","急診室","the emergency room 急診室；emergency exit 緊急出口；crisis n. 危機","Because of the bad weather, the pilot had to make an emergency landing.","由於天候不佳，飛行員不得不緊急降落。"],["creative","有創造力的","create vt. 創造；creativity n. 創造力；imaginative a. 富想像力的；inventive a. 有創意的；innovative a. 創新的；original a. 原創的；creative writing 創意寫作；creator n. 創造者；destroyer n. 破壞者","A creative advertisement requires intelligence and imagination.","一則有創意的廣告需要智慧與想像力。"],["creature","生物","living thing 生物","Humans are creatures of habit.","人類是習慣的動物。"],["creator","創造者","inventor n. 發明者；destroyer n. 破壞者","Walt Disney was the creator of Mickey Mouse.","華特・迪士尼是米老鼠的創造者。"],["media","媒體（複數）","medium（單數）；the mass media 大眾傳播媒體","The political party accused the media of being biased.","該政黨指責媒體有所偏頗。"],["extreme","極端的；極端","go to extremes 走極端；excessive a. 過度的；extremely adv. 極端地；exceedingly adv. 非常；excessively adv. 過度地；exceptionally adv. 異常地","You should handle the problem with extreme caution.","你應該極度小心地處理這個問題。"],["extremely","極端地；非常","exceedingly / excessively / exceptionally adv.","I was extremely happy upon hearing the good news.","聽到這個好消息時，我非常高興。"],["plenty","很多；大量","plenty of + 複數名詞／不可數名詞；plentiful a. 充足的","There are plenty of activities to do on the beach during the summertime.","夏季時海灘上有許多活動可做。"],["wagon","四輪貨車","van n. 廂型車；麵包車","Tom plans to journey across America in a covered wagon.","湯姆打算乘著篷車橫越美國。"],["van","廂型車；麵包車","—","I'm moving to my new apartment this Sunday. Would you lend me your van?","我這星期日要搬到新公寓。你可以把廂型車借我嗎？"],["dare","敢於；膽敢；挑戰","dare sb to + V 激某人做……；challenge sb to + V；I dare (that)...；How dare you...? 你怎敢……？","I dare not tell my parents that I'm getting married soon.","我不敢告訴父母我很快就要結婚了。"],["scholar","學者","scholarly a. 學者的；有學問的；a scholarly statesman 學者型政治家；scholarship n. 獎學金／學問","The author of this book is also a famous scholar in his country.","這本書的作者也是他國內一位著名學者。"],["scholarship","獎學金；學問","study on a scholarship 靠獎學金就學","The intelligent young girl is studying at Harvard on a government scholarship.","這位聰明的年輕女孩靠政府獎學金在哈佛就讀。"],["risk","風險；冒險","take/run the risk of + V-ing 冒……風險；at risk 處於危險之中；risk one's life 冒生命危險；risk + N/V-ing","Parents shouldn't run the risk of leaving their children alone.","父母不應冒險把孩子單獨留下。"],["loose","寬鬆的；鬆動的","come loose 鬆開；tight a. 緊的","My brother likes to wear loose clothes and pants.","我哥哥喜歡穿寬鬆的衣服和褲子。"],["persuade","說服；勸服","persuade sb to + V 說服某人做……；talk sb into + V-ing；persuade sb not to + V；talk sb out of + V-ing；Could you dissuade Tom from talking so loudly?；persuasion n. 說服；persuasive a. 有說服力的；convincing a. 令人信服的","Try to persuade Jerry to apologize to the teacher.","試著說服傑瑞向老師道歉。"],["cone","圓錐體","an ice cream cone 冰淇淋甜筒","I set a warning cone behind the car to avoid further accidents.","我在車後放了一個警示錐，以避免更多事故。"],["odd","奇怪的；奇數的；零散的","odds n. 機率；strange a. 奇怪的；odd numbers 奇數；even numbers 偶數；1,3,5...；2,4,6...","Paul looks odd today. What's wrong with him?","保羅今天看起來怪怪的。他怎麼了？"],["breath","呼吸；一口氣","take a deep breath 深呼吸；catch one's breath 喘口氣；a breath of wind 一絲風；breathtaking a. 令人屏息的；breathe vi. & vt. 呼吸；breathe in/out 吸氣／吐氣","I always take a deep breath before going on the stage.","我上臺前總會深呼吸。"],["release","釋放；發行；釋放／發行","release sb from... 釋放某人脫離……；release a film/movie 發行電影；release names 公布姓名；release tension 舒緩緊張；release a report 發布報告","After ten years in prison, the prisoner was released this morning.","服刑十年後，這名囚犯今天早上獲釋。"],["temper","脾氣","keep/lose one's temper 忍住／發脾氣","I've never seen Victoria lose her temper.","我從未看過維多利亞發脾氣。"],["cotton","棉；棉花","a cotton ball 棉球；a cotton swab 棉花棒","All of our T-shirts are made of pure cotton.","我們所有的 T 恤都是純棉製的。"],["lily","百合","—","The lilies in the garden are in full bloom.","花園裡的百合正盛開。"],["straw","吸管；稻草","the last straw 最後一根稻草；hay n. 乾草；Make hay while the sun shines. 把握時機；Finding the missing ring here is like looking for a needle in the hay. 大海撈針","You look very charming when you wear that straw hat.","你戴那頂草帽時看起來很迷人。"],["flour","麵粉","flour 與 flower 同音；flour the bottom of the bowl 在碗底撒麵粉","To make a cake, you need flour and eggs.","做蛋糕需要麵粉和雞蛋。"],["tunnel","隧道","—","A tunnel is being built between the two cities.","兩座城市之間正在興建一條隧道。"],["quit","停止；離開；辭職","quit, quit, quit；quit smoking 戒菸；give up smoking；stop + V-ing 停止做……；quit one's job 辭職；quit + N/V-ing；continue to + V/V-ing 繼續……","Paula announced that she will quit show business next year.","寶拉宣布明年將退出演藝圈。"],["intelligent","聰明的","intelligence n. 智慧；wit n. 機智；clever a. 聰明的；bright a. 聰明的","Lisa is intelligent and hardworking, which is why all her teachers like her.","麗莎既聰明又勤奮，所以所有老師都喜歡她。"],["exhibition","展覽會","be on exhibition 展出中；be on display；exhibit vt. 展示；n. 展覽品；exhibition hall 展覽館","There will be an exhibition of modern sculpture next month.","下個月將有一場現代雕塑展。"]],"U10":[["electronic","電子的","electric a. 電的；電動的；an electric appliance 家用電器；electrical a. 與電有關的；electrician n. 電工；electricity n. 電","To our surprise, Penny plays the electronic organ very well.","令我們驚訝的是，佩妮電子琴彈得非常好。"],["electricity","電","electric / electrical / electronic 相關字","This commuter train runs on electricity.","這班通勤列車是以電驅動的。"],["shiny","發亮的；有光澤的","glossy a. 有光澤的；shine vi. 照耀 & vt. 擦亮","I found a shiny new coin on the ground and picked it up.","我在地上發現一枚閃亮的新硬幣，便把它撿起來。"],["palace","皇宮","place n. 地方 & vt. 放置","Buckingham Palace is one of the Queen’s six homes.","白金漢宮是英國女王六個住所之一。"],["rank","階級；地位；排名","the rank and file 所有基層成員；grade / class n. 等級；rank first = come in first 排名第一","People from all ranks of society deserve equal treatment.","社會各階層人士都應得到平等的待遇。"],["rough","粗糙的；粗略的；粗暴的","have a rough idea of sth 對某事略知一二；be rough on sb 對某人嚴厲；uneven / coarse / brutal / violent a.；rough draft 草稿","Mom’s hands are rough from hard work.","媽媽的雙手因辛苦工作而變得粗糙。"],["roughly","粗略地；大約","briefly adv. 簡略地；roughly = some / about / approximately / around（約）","Nicole described roughly to me the planned course of action.","妮可向我粗略地描述預定的行動計畫。"],["entry","入口","entrance n. 入口（與介詞 to 並用）；exit n. 出口（與介詞 from 並用）","The main entry to the stadium is across the road.","體育場的主要入口在馬路對面。"],["proof","證明；防……的","prove vi. 證明 & vt. 證實；proof of... ……的證明；waterproof 防水的；soundproof 隔音的；bulletproof 防彈的；fireproof 防火的","I wouldn’t demand proof of loyalty from a friend.","我不會向朋友要求忠誠的證明。"],["owe","欠；歸功於","owe sb sth 欠某人某物；owe A to B 把 A 歸因於 B；attribute A to B","You still owe me NT$1,000, and you seem to have forgotten it.","你還欠我新臺幣 1,000 元，而且你好像忘了。"],["owing","欠著的；未付清的","owing to... 由於 = due to / on account of / as a result of","Owing to poor management, the factory shut down 2 years after it was established.","由於管理不善，這家工廠成立兩年後便倒閉了。"],["sin","罪惡；犯罪","sin, sinned, sinned；sinful a. 有罪的；crime 指法律上的罪，sin 指良心／道德上的罪","In the eyes of my boss, wasting time is a sin.","在我老闆眼中，浪費時間是一種罪惡。"],["navy","海軍","naval a. 海軍的；air force 空軍；army 陸軍；marine corps 海軍陸戰隊；bribery n. 賄賂；corruption n. 貪腐；air base 空軍基地；barracks n. 營房；PX / post exchange 福利社","Nancy’s grandfather was in the navy during the war.","南西的祖父在戰爭期間曾服役於海軍。"],["violence","暴力；猛烈","cruelty n. 殘酷；brutality n. 殘暴；resort to... 訴諸……","You can’t resort to violence just because you can’t reason with someone.","你不能只因無法跟別人理論就訴諸暴力。"],["violent","暴力的；猛烈的","cruel / brutal a.；violently adv. 激烈地；粗暴地；vehemently adv. 激烈地；cruelly / brutally adv.","Beethoven’s father was a violent and dangerous man.","貝多芬的父親是一個粗暴而又危險的人。"],["concert","一致；協調（不可數）；音樂會；演唱會（可數）","work in concert with... 與……同心協力；put on / hold a concert 舉辦演唱會","We should work in concert with one another to improve the quality of our lives.","我們應該同心協力改善生活品質。"],["poll","民意調查；做問卷調查","reveal vt. 顯示；survey n. 調查 & vt. 調查；deteriorate vi. 惡化；burglar n. 竊賊","A nationwide poll revealed different opinions among young voters.","一項全國性民調顯示年輕選民之間有不同意見。"],["survey","調查；調查／勘察","deteriorate vi. 惡化；burglar n. 竊賊","According to a recent survey, the quality of life in Taiwan is deteriorating.","根據最近的一項調查，臺灣的生活品質正在惡化。"],["investigate","調查（案件）","investigate a case = look into a case；investigation n. 調查；probe vt. 調查","The police are still investigating the case.","警方仍在調查這個案件。"],["automatic","自動的","automated a. 自動化的；automatically adv. 自動地；on one’s own 自動地","Automatic cameras are getting more and more popular these days.","自動照相機現在越來越流行了。"],["automatically","自動地","on one’s own 自動地","The dishwasher will stop automatically when the dishes are clean.","碗盤洗乾淨後，洗碗機會自動停止。"],["bullet","子彈","fire a bullet at... 朝……開槍；the bullet train 子彈列車；a bullet hole 彈孔；bulletin n. 公告","The police fired a bullet at the thief as he ran away.","小偷逃跑時，警方朝他開了一槍。"],["ownership","所有權","own vt. 擁有；owner n. 所有者；主人","Tom and John had a fight over the ownership of the land.","湯姆和約翰為了這塊土地的所有權而爭吵。"],["similarity","相似（不可數）；相似之處（可數）","bear similarity to... = bear a resemblance to... 與……相似；similar a. 相似的；resemblance n. 相似；difference n. 差異","There is little similarity between the two sisters.","這兩姊妹幾乎沒有相似之處。"],["relax","放鬆；休息","relaxation n. 放鬆；unwind vt. & vi. 放鬆；relaxed a. 放鬆的／寬鬆的；relaxing a. 令人放鬆的；loose a. 寬鬆的；carefree a. 無憂無慮的","Listening to music can help me relax.","聽音樂可以幫助我放鬆。"],["relaxed","放鬆的；寬鬆的","relaxing a. 令人放鬆的","School regulations have become more and more relaxed.","校規已變得越來越寬鬆。"],["stir","攪拌；騷動","stir, stirred, stirred；stir up... 激起……；stir up trouble 惹麻煩；cause a stir 引起騷動；mixture n. 混合物","I stirred my coffee with a spoon.","我用湯匙攪拌咖啡。"],["territory","領土；地盤","territorial a. 領土的；turf n. 地盤","It is not uncommon for dogs to fight over food and territory.","狗為了搶食物及地盤而打架是屢見不鮮的事。"],["sip","啜飲；小口喝；一小口","sip, sipped, sipped；take a sip of... 喝一小口……","The guy sitting at the bar sipping coffee is my boyfriend.","那個坐在吧檯喝咖啡的男生是我男友。"],["wisdom","智慧","wise a. 明智的；intelligence n. 智力／智慧；wisdom 偏生活經驗上的智慧，intelligence 偏課業、學術上的智慧","Aristotle was a man of great wisdom.","亞里斯多德是一位很有智慧的人。"],["meanwhile","同時","meantime adv. & n. 同時；in the meanwhile = in the meantime = meanwhile / meantime","I’ll do the cooking; meanwhile, you can do the laundry for me.","我來做飯；同時，你可以幫我洗衣服。"],["wheat","小麥","oat n. 燕麥；barley n. 大麥；rye n. 黑麥；buckwheat n. 蕎麥；grain n. 穀物","Flour is made from wheat.","麵粉是由小麥製成的。"],["compete","競爭","compete with sb for sth 與某人競爭某物；competition n. 競爭；competitive a. 有競爭力的；competitor n. 競爭者；competent a. 有能力的；competence n. 能力","No computer can compete with this one in terms of speed.","就速度而言，沒有任何電腦能比得上這一臺。"],["ton","噸；大量","tons of work 許多工作；a lot of work 大量工作","The truck weighs over two tons and cannot cross the bridge.","這輛卡車重超過兩噸，因此不能過橋。"],["pea","豌豆","mung bean n. 綠豆；soybean n. 黃豆；adzuki bean n. 紅豆","My favorite dish is roast chicken with peas and vegetables.","我最喜歡的菜是烤雞配豌豆和蔬菜。"],["controller","控制器；控制人員","flight traffic controller 飛航管制員","Please press the controller to turn the machine on.","請按控制器把機器打開。"],["county","郡；縣","province n. 省；city n. 市","John grew up in Taichung County.","約翰在臺中縣長大。"],["awkward","笨拙的；尷尬的","clumsy a. 笨拙的","Sue is quite awkward and falls over a lot.","蘇相當笨拙，常常跌倒。"],["talent","天才；天分","have a talent for... 有……天分；be talented in... 在……方面有天分；talented a. 有天分的；gifted a. 有天分的；versatile a. 多才多藝的","Mary has a talent for drawing.","瑪麗有繪畫天分。"],["talented","有天分的","gifted a. 有天分的；versatile a. 多才多藝的","The lack of talented people makes it hard for the government to carry out the project.","缺乏有才華的人，使政府很難執行這項計畫。"],["shortly","不久；立刻","shortly after / before... 在……之後／之前不久；immediately after / before...","Mary successfully found a well-paid job shortly after she graduated from college.","瑪麗大學畢業後不久便順利找到一份待遇優渥的工作。"],["organize","組織","organized a. 有組織的；organizer n. 組織者","Ted organized these workers into a union.","泰德將這些工人組織成一個工會。"],["pronounce","發音；宣判","pronunciation n. 發音","How do you pronounce your last name?","你的姓怎麼發音？"],["assume","認定；假設；承擔（責任）","assume the burden of... = shoulder the burden of... 負起……責任；assumption n. 假設","Paul assumed that his girlfriend was joking when she said he was ugly.","保羅的女友說他很醜時，他認定她一定是在開玩笑。"]],"U11":[["forever","永遠","forever and a day 永永遠遠；for good 永久地","After working 20 years in New York, John is planning on going back to his hometown in Minneapolis and staying there forever.","在紐約工作 20 年後，約翰計畫回到明尼亞波利斯的故鄉並永遠住在那裡。"],["temporary","暫時的","on a temporary basis 暫時地；permanent a. 永久的；temporarily adv. 暫時地；permanently adv. 永久地","The hunter made a temporary shelter out of stone.","獵人用石頭搭了一個臨時住所。"],["temporarily","暫時地","relieved a. 感到寬慰的","After taking the medicine, Amber felt temporarily relieved.","吃了藥之後，安柏暫時感到舒坦一些。"],["maid","女僕","servant n. 僕人；butler n. 管家；luxurious a. 奢華的","Having a butler, three maids, and two gardeners to take care of his needs, the millionaire leads a luxurious life.","這個百萬富翁有一個管家、三個女僕及兩個園丁照料他的需求，過著奢華的生活。"],["resist","抵抗；忍住","cannot resist + V-ing = cannot help + V-ing = cannot help but + V；resistant a. 抵抗的；be resistant to sth；resistance n. 抵抗","How can you resist chocolate cake? Whenever I see some, I must have a piece.","你怎能抗拒巧克力蛋糕？我每次看到都非吃一塊不可。"],["guidance","指導；引導","under sb’s guidance 在某人指導下；guide vt. 指導；instruction n. 指示；教導","Under Coach Lee’s guidance and leadership, I’m sure we’ll win the contest.","在李教練的指導與領導下，我相信我們會贏得這場比賽。"],["accurate","準確的；精確的","accuracy n. 準確；precise a. 精確的；inaccurate a. 不準確的","Though the clock is old, it is still accurate.","這個鐘雖然舊了，仍然很準確。"],["sake","理由；緣故","for the sake of... 為了……；for sb’s sake 為了某人","For the sake of your health, you should break the habit of smoking immediately.","為了你的健康，你應該立刻戒掉抽菸的習慣。"],["toss","拋；扔；擲；拋擲","toss and turn 輾轉反側；a toss of a coin 擲硬幣；throw vt. 丟；crumple vt. 揉皺","After reading the letter, David crumpled it up and tossed it into the fire.","大衛看完信之後，就把信揉成一團丟到火裡去了。"],["reserve","預訂；保留；儲備；保護區","keep sth in reserve 儲備某物；reservation n. 預訂；reservoir n. 水庫；preserve vt. 保護；保存；book vt. 預訂","I’d like to reserve a room for three nights.","我要訂房住三晚。"],["harbor","港口；庇護；心懷","a harbor city = a port city 港都；harbor a grudge against sb = bear a grudge against sb 對某人懷恨；port n. 港口","Hong Kong is a harbor city.","香港是個港都。"],["dock","碼頭；扣除","in dock 在碼頭；dock sb’s pay / wages / salary 扣某人的薪資；wharf n. 碼頭","The ships were all in dock before the typhoon approached.","颱風接近前，船隻全都停靠在碼頭。"],["trail","跟蹤；拖曳；小徑","trail sb to + 地方 = track/follow sb to + 地方；track n. 軌跡；path n. 小徑；tug vt. 拖拉","The policeman trailed the suspect to the house he lived in.","那名警察跟蹤嫌犯到他住的地方。"],["faint","昏眩的；微弱的；昏倒；昏厥","feel faint 感到暈眩；not have the faintest/foggiest/slightest idea = have no idea 一點也不知道；pass out 昏倒","I didn’t eat anything today and I feel faint with hunger now.","我今天什麼也沒吃，現在餓得發暈。"],["trace","追蹤；查出；痕跡","disappear without a trace 消失得無影無蹤；track vt. 追蹤；ancestor n. 祖先","It isn’t easy to trace your ancestors, especially your female relatives.","追查祖先並不容易，尤其是女性親屬。"],["steady","穩定的；使穩定；穩定地；固定交往的情侶","steady, steadied, steadied；go steady (with sb) 穩定交往；steadily adv. 不斷地；漸漸地","It’s hard to find a steady job these days.","現在很難找到一份穩定的工作。"],["steadily","不斷地；漸漸地","progressively / gradually adv. 漸漸地","With the breeze blowing steadily from the window, I couldn’t help but fall asleep.","微風從窗口徐徐吹來，我忍不住睡著了。"],["stable","穩定的","be in stable/critical condition 情況穩定／危急；critical a. 危急的；stabilize vt. 使穩定","The company is currently stable and doing well.","這家公司目前狀況穩定，運作良好。"],["injury","傷害；損害","injuries（複數）；injure vt. 傷害；recover from... 從……復原；scandal n. 醜聞；reputation n. 名聲","It took three weeks for Sam to recover from his sports injury.","山姆花了三週才從運動傷害中復原。"],["dealer","商人；經銷商","a car dealer 汽車商；an antique dealer 古董商；deal in used cars 從事中古車買賣；merchant / trader n. 商人；trade n. 貿易","Paul has made a lot of money as an antique dealer.","保羅當古董商賺了很多錢。"],["admire","欽佩；欣賞","admire sb for sth 因某事欽佩某人；admirable a. 令人欽佩的；admiration n. 欽佩；appreciate vt. 欣賞；think highly of... 看得起","I admire Justin for his proficiency in English.","賈斯汀的英文造詣令我折服。"],["heel","腳後跟；鞋跟；替鞋裝跟","hard on one’s heels 緊追不捨；high heels 高跟鞋；a pair of high heels 一雙高跟鞋；cliff n. 懸崖；gracefully adv. 優雅地","With the enemy army hard on his heels, the soldier had no choice but to jump off the cliff.","由於後頭敵軍窮追不捨，這名士兵別無選擇，只好跳下懸崖。"],["satisfactory","令人滿意的","satisfy vt. 使滿意；satisfying a. 令人愉快／滿足的；satisfied a. 滿意的；be satisfied with...；satisfaction n. 滿意","I couldn’t get a satisfactory explanation for what had occurred.","對於所發生的事，我找不到滿意的解釋。"],["satisfactorily","令人滿意地","—","The conference has been progressing satisfactorily so far.","這場會議至今進行得還算令人滿意。"],["splash","潑水；濺水；水花；引起轟動","splash water on sb；splash about/around 到處潑水；make a splash 引起轟動；sensation n. 轟動；bathe vt. 為……洗澡；debut n. 初次登臺","The baby splashed water on her mother as her mother bathed her.","小寶寶在媽媽幫她洗澡時，潑水到媽媽身上。"],["impress","使印象深刻；使銘記","be impressed with sth；impress sb with sth = impress sth on/upon sb；impressive a. 令人印象深刻的；impression n. 印象；想法","I was deeply impressed with the city’s boulevard.","這個城市的林蔭大道令我印象深刻。"],["melt","融化；使融化；心軟","melt away 融化消失；a melting pot 大熔爐；diversity n. 多樣性","The sun melted the ice in the buckets before the party even started.","派對都還沒開始，太陽就把好幾桶的冰塊融化了。"],["desirable","適合的；妥當的；值得嚮往的；合意的","It is desirable that + S + (should) + V 最好……；alternative n. 替代方案；wrongdoing n. 不當行為","That busy corner is a desirable place for a restaurant.","那個車水馬龍的角落很適合開一家餐廳。"],["desire","渴望；慾望","leave nothing to be desired 無可挑剔；leave much to be desired 尚待改進；a desire for...；have a desire to + V","Everyone desires happiness.","每個人都渴望幸福。"],["badly","拙劣地；嚴重地；非常","need sth badly = be badly in need of sth 非常需要某物","Kelly plays the piano very badly.","凱莉的鋼琴彈得很差。"],["colony","殖民地；群體","colonies（複數）；a colony of ants/bees 一群螞蟻／蜜蜂；colonial a. 殖民地的；colonize vt. 殖民","New York was originally a Dutch colony.","紐約原本是荷蘭的殖民地。"],["efficient","有效率的","effective a. 有效的；inefficient a. 無效率的；consume vt. 消耗","A boss likes nothing more than a faithful and efficient worker.","老闆最喜歡忠實又有效率的員工。"],["stale","不新鮮的；無新意的；令人厭倦的","go stale 變得乏味／沒有興趣；stale bread 不新鮮的麵包；a stale joke 老掉牙的笑話；decayed / flat / boring a.；fresh a. 新鮮的","The man left his wife when he found their marriage had gone stale.","這個男子發現跟太太的婚姻已變得索然無味時，便離開了她。"],["ambassador","大使（與介詞 to 並用）","consul n. 領事；diplomat n. 外交官；embassy n. 大使館","Who is the Japanese ambassador to South Africa?","日本駐南非大使是誰？"],["alphabet","字母（總稱）；字母表","letter n. 字母；alphabetical a. 按字母順序的","There are 26 letters in the English alphabet.","英文字母表共有 26 個字母。"],["crab","螃蟹","crabbed a. 潦草難讀的；crabbed handwriting 潦草的筆跡；claw n. 螯","A crab has two large claws.","螃蟹有兩隻大螯。"],["global","全球的；全世界的","global warming 全球暖化；globe n. 地球；球體","This could become a global problem.","這可能成為全球性的問題。"],["foggy","有霧的","fog n. 霧；sunny 晴朗的；cloudy 多雲的；rainy 下雨的；snowy 下雪的；windy 有風的","It’s dangerous to drive on foggy days.","在有霧的日子開車很危險。"],["dumb","啞的；愚笨的","play dumb 裝傻；stupid a. 愚笨的；mute a. 啞的；blind a. 失明的；deaf a. 失聰的；deaf and dumb 又聾又啞","People who can’t speak used to be called “dumb”; now we call them “mute.”","以前不能說話的人被稱為「dumb」，現在則用「mute」一字形容。"],["pump","抽取；打氣；泵浦","pump...up / pump up... 打氣；pump sth into... 把……注入……；pumper n. 抽水機","We need to pump the water out of the basement.","我們必須把水從地下室抽出去。"],["subtract","減去","subtract A from B 從 B 減去 A；add vt. 加；plus prep. 加；minus prep. 減／零下／負數；the minus sign 減號；multiply vt. 乘；multiply A by B = multiply A and B；times prep. 乘；divide vt. 除","Subtract five from ten, and you’ll get five.","10 減 5 等於 5。"]],"U12":[["capture","捕捉；俘虜；吸引；捕獲","capture / catch sb’s attention 吸引某人注意；capture the headlines 成為頭條；arrest vt. 逮捕；seize vt. 抓住；apprehend vt. 逮捕；rebel n. 叛軍／反叛者","Police have finally captured the leader of the criminal organization.","警方終於逮捕了犯罪組織的首領。"],["ambition","野心；抱負","drive n. 幹勁；determination n. 決心；ambitious a. 有野心的","Mike’s ambition is to become the chess champion.","麥克的志向是成為西洋棋冠軍。"],["rely","依賴；依靠","rely, relied, relied；rely on/upon... = depend on/upon... 依賴……","A happy marriage relies on mutual trust.","幸福的婚姻有賴於彼此的信任。"],["reliable","可靠的","dependable a. 可靠的；forecast n. 預報","The weather forecast is not always reliable, so you’d better carry an umbrella with you just in case.","天氣預報並不總是可靠，所以你最好隨身帶把傘以防萬一。"],["holy","神聖的","divine a. 神聖的；sacred a. 神聖的","Nothing is holy for Paul; he only believes in money.","對保羅而言沒有什麼是神聖的；他只相信金錢。"],["survivor","倖存者","survive vi. & vt. 倖存／存活；survival n. 生存","No survivors were found in this airplane crash.","這起空難中沒有發現任何生還者。"],["wicked","邪惡的","wickedness n. 邪惡；evil a. 邪惡的；rip sb off 敲某人竹槓","Snow White’s wicked stepmother is very jealous of her stepdaughter’s beauty.","白雪公主邪惡的繼母非常嫉妒她繼女的美貌。"],["innocent","無辜的；天真的","be innocent of... 未犯……；innocence n. 清白／天真；be incapable of... 不可能做……","The suspect claimed to be innocent of the robbery, but no one believed him.","嫌犯聲稱自己沒有犯下搶劫案，但沒有人相信他。"],["restrict","限制","restrict A to B 把 A 限制在 B；restricted a. 受限制的；restriction n. 限制；limit vt. 限制；martial law 戒嚴","Hoping that she could eventually quit smoking, Mary started restricting her smoking to half a pack a day.","希望最後能戒菸，瑪麗開始把每天的吸菸量限制在半包。"],["pause","暫停；停頓","pause to + V 停下來做……；silence n. 沉默；break n. 休息","There was a long, embarrassing pause after Tommy asked a stupid question.","湯米問了一個愚蠢的問題後，出現了一段漫長又尷尬的沉默。"],["darkness","黑暗","dark a. 黑暗的；after dark 天黑後；keep sb in the dark about sth 不讓某人知道某事；power failure 停電","It’s very dangerous to drive in such darkness without headlights.","在如此黑暗的情況下不開車燈駕駛非常危險。"],["darken","變暗；使變暗","—","The theater room darkened and then the film began.","戲院內暗了下來，接著電影開始播放。"],["fortune","運氣；財富","make a fortune 發財；cost sb a fortune 花某人一大筆錢；fortunate a. 幸運的；misfortune n. 不幸；a fortune teller 算命師；fate n. 命運；superb a. 極佳的","Frank always says it’s his good fortune to work with so many brilliant and talented people here in this company.","法蘭克總說，能和公司裡這麼多優秀又有才華的人共事是他的幸運。"],["remote","偏遠的；關係疏遠的；可能性極小的","a remote control 遙控器；a remote relative 遠親；a remote chance 極小的可能；distant a. 遙遠的；color-blind a. 色盲的","No gas station can be found in such a remote town.","在這麼偏遠的小鎮找不到加油站。"],["assist","協助","assist sb in + V-ing = help sb (to) V 幫助某人做……；assistance n. 協助；come to sb’s assistance 幫助某人；assistant n. 助理 & a. 助理的","I assist Mom in doing the housework on weekends.","我週末幫媽媽做家事。"],["assistance","協助","come to sb’s assistance 幫助某人","If everybody assists, the job will get done quickly.","如果每個人都幫忙，工作很快就會完成。"],["assistant","助理；助理的","personal assistant 私人助理；assistant manager 副理","The boss always hires attractive personal assistants.","老闆總是雇用外表亮眼的私人助理。"],["scatter","撒；使散開；散開；零星的一群","spread vt. & vi. 散布；slip vi. 滑倒；mob n. 暴民；mobster n. 幫派分子","You can scatter some sand on the ice so you don’t slip.","你可以在冰上撒些沙，這樣就不會滑倒。"],["regional","地區的；區域的","region n. 地區；recession n. 經濟衰退；zone n. 區域 & vt. 劃分區域；area n. 地區；district n. 區域","Economic recession in these countries is partly caused by regional conflicts.","這些國家的經濟衰退有一部分是區域衝突所造成的。"],["zone","區域；將……劃為特定用途區","war zone 戰區；zone sth for... 將某地劃作……用途","Louise volunteered to go to the war zone to report on the war.","露易絲自願前往戰區報導戰爭。"],["grab","抓住；攫取","grab, grabbed, grabbed；grab a bite to eat 隨便吃點東西；make a grab for sth 伸手搶某物；seize vt. 抓住","I grabbed a bite to eat this morning and then went to work.","我今天早上隨便吃了點東西就去上班了。"],["grasp","抓牢；理解；緊握","grasp sb by the arm 抓住某人的手臂；grasp the meaning of... 理解……的意思","A man in a black suit grasped Paul by the arm and shook him violently, telling him to stay out of their business.","一名穿黑西裝的男子抓住保羅的手臂猛烈搖晃，要他別管他們的事。"],["horn","角；喇叭","honk the horn 按喇叭；play/blow one’s own horn/trumpet 自吹自擂；trumpet n. 小號；loudspeaker n. 擴音器","Some goats have large and magnificent horns.","有些山羊長著又大又漂亮的角。"],["whistle","口哨；哨子；吹口哨；鳴笛","blow a whistle 吹哨；whistle at sb 對某人吹口哨；tuneless a. 不成調的；referee n. 裁判","I knew Uncle George was around when I heard that tuneless whistle of his.","當我聽到喬治叔叔那不成調的口哨聲時，就知道他在附近。"],["dine","用餐","dine in 在家用餐；dine out 外出用餐","Who are you going to dine out with tonight?","你今晚要和誰出去吃飯？"],["suburb","郊區","in the suburbs of... 在……郊區；outskirts n. 郊區；urban a. 都市的；urbanize vt. 都市化；urbanization n. 都市化；rural a. 鄉村的","Judy used to live in the suburbs of London.","茱蒂以前住在倫敦郊區。"],["strip","剝去；脫掉；長條","strip, stripped, stripped；strip sb of sth 剝奪某人某物；strip off = take off one’s clothes 脫衣服；stripe n. 條紋；naked a. 裸體的","We’ll have to strip the posters off the wall before we start painting.","開始粉刷前，我們得先把牆上的海報撕下來。"],["graduate","畢業；畢業生；研究所的","graduate from... 從……畢業；graduate school 研究所；graduate student 研究生；undergraduate student 大學生；graduation n. 畢業；undergraduate n. & a. 大學生／大學部的","Mary graduated in history from Yale University last year.","瑪麗去年從耶魯大學歷史系畢業。"],["coconut","椰子","ingredient n. 成分；材料；cuisine n. 菜餚／料理","Coconut milk is an important ingredient of Thai cuisine.","椰奶是泰國料理的重要材料。"],["hesitate","猶豫","hesitate about/over sth 對某事猶豫；don’t hesitate to + V 儘管做……；hesitant a. 猶豫的；hesitation n. 猶豫","Katherine is still hesitating about whether or not to marry Kevin.","凱瑟琳仍在猶豫是否要嫁給凱文。"],["fist","拳頭；用拳頭打","shake sb’s fist at... 對……揮拳","The angry driver shook his fist at the slow-moving pedestrian.","生氣的駕駛對那名走得很慢的行人揮拳。"],["wrist","手腕","a wristband 腕帶；a knee band 護膝","I sprained my wrist bowling.","我打保齡球時扭傷了手腕。"],["elbow","手肘；用手肘推擠","elbow one’s way 擠出一條路；elbow sb out of the way 用手肘把某人推開","Jenny hurt her elbow when playing tennis.","珍妮打網球時傷到了手肘。"],["buzz","嗡嗡叫；忙碌穿梭；嗡嗡聲；打電話","buzz around 四處忙碌；give sb a buzz = give sb a call/ring = call sb (up) 打電話給某人","Bees were buzzing around the flowers in the garden.","蜜蜂在花園的花朵四周嗡嗡飛舞。"],["hum","哼唱；發出嗡嗡聲；嗡嗡聲","hum, hummed, hummed","Jeff was humming a song while taking a shower.","傑夫洗澡時哼著一首歌。"],["waterfall","瀑布","cascade n. 瀑布","The boat went over the waterfall, and no one survived.","船越過瀑布墜下，無人生還。"],["flood","洪水；淹沒；氾濫","a flood of... 大量……；be flooded with... 湧入大量……；resident n. 居民","The flood ruined hundreds of houses and claimed twenty lives.","洪水摧毀了數百棟房屋，並奪走二十條人命。"],["cafeteria","自助餐廳；學校／公司餐廳","café n. 咖啡館","I’ve heard that the cafeteria over there has excellent food.","我聽說那邊的自助餐廳餐點很棒。"],["dawn","黎明；開始；開始明白","at dawn 在黎明；since the dawn of history 自有歷史以來；it dawns on sb that... 某人開始明白……；daybreak n. 黎明；at daybreak 在黎明；immortality n. 永生","The couple got up at dawn to watch the sunrise together.","這對夫妻黎明時起床，一起看日出。"],["dusk","黃昏","at dusk 在黃昏","When Carl lost that game, it dawned on him that he could never make it.","卡爾輸掉那場比賽時，他開始明白自己永遠不可能成功。"],["bind","綁；束縛","bind, bound, bound；bind A to B 把 A 綁在 B；bound a. 被束縛的","I think you should bind the old papers into a bundle before putting them outside.","我想你應該先把舊報紙綁成一捆，再放到外面。"],["dishonest","不誠實的","untruthful a. 不誠實的；deceitful a. 欺騙的；honest a. 誠實的","I can see Tom has been doing things in a dishonest manner.","我看得出來湯姆一直以不誠實的方式做事。"],["operation","操作；手術","perform an operation on... = perform surgery on... 為……動手術；surgery n. 手術；operate vt. 操作／動手術；operator n. 操作者；operational a. 操作上的","Are you familiar with the operation of this machine?","你熟悉這部機器的操作嗎？"],["crane","起重機；鶴；伸長脖子","crane one’s neck 伸長脖子；operate a crane 操作起重機；egret n. 白鷺鷥","You have to get a license to operate a crane.","你必須取得執照才能操作起重機。"],["basement","地下室","cellar n. 地窖／地下室","During the storm, everyone went to the basement for safety.","暴風雨期間，每個人都到地下室避難。"],["bet","打賭；賭注","bet, bet, bet；I bet... 我敢說……；bet money on sth 在某事上下注；place/put a bet (on sth) 下賭注；inexperienced a. 缺乏經驗的","I bet you Betty is still in the office.","我敢說貝蒂還在辦公室裡。"]],"U13":[["cast","投；擲；投票；演員陣容；石膏模","cast, cast, cast；cast the die 擲骰子；cast a ballot / vote 投票；cast a look at... 看……一眼；throw vt. 投、擲；plot n. 劇情；plaster cast 石膏模；heal vi. 癒合","James cast the die to start the game.","詹姆士擲骰子開始遊戲。"],["squeeze","擠；榨；擠入；擠壓；少量","squeeze into... 擠進……；squeeze sth out 擠出某物；squeeze sb’s hand 握／捏某人的手；pimple n. 青春痘；scar n. 疤痕；press vt. 壓","Don’t squeeze your pimples unless you want scars on your face.","除非你想在臉上留下疤痕，否則不要擠青春痘。"],["twist","扭；轉；扭曲；扭轉","twist one’s head around 轉頭；twist the truth 扭曲事實；twist sb’s words 曲解某人的話；distort vt. 扭曲；sprain vt. 扭傷","I twisted my head around to see what was going on.","我轉過頭去看發生了什麼事。"],["award","獎；獎項；授予","prize n. 獎品；award sb sth 頒給某人某物；be awarded sth 被頒予某物；celebrity n. 名人","Many celebrities attended the awards ceremony.","許多名人出席了頒獎典禮。"],["medal","獎章；獎牌","a gold medal 金牌；a silver medal 銀牌；a bronze medal 銅牌","Officer Smith was given a medal for his brave deeds.","史密斯警官因英勇事蹟而獲頒一枚獎章。"],["drip","滴；滴下；滴水聲","drip, dripped, dripped；drop vi. & n. 滴落／水滴；dribble vi. & n. 滴下／細流","Water dripped from my ceiling during rainstorms.","下雨時，水從我家的天花板滴下來。"],["journey","旅行；旅程；旅行","trip n. 旅行；journey to + 地方；go on a journey / trip to...；take a trip to...；travel to...","Peter has decided to go on a journey to southern Taiwan next month.","彼得已決定下個月到臺灣南部旅行。"],["client","客戶","customer n. 顧客","We can’t afford to lose Mr. Johnson. He’s a very important client of ours.","我們不能失去強森先生，他是我們非常重要的客戶。"],["precious","珍貴的；寶貴的","valuable a. 有價值的","Time is precious, and we cannot afford to waste it.","時間很寶貴，我們浪費不起。"],["jet","噴射機；搭噴射機快速前往；噴射","jet, jetted, jetted；a passenger jet 客機；a jet fighter 噴射戰鬥機；jet lag 時差；jet off to... 搭機快速前往……","Mr. Stevenson is so rich that he even has his own jet.","史蒂文森先生非常有錢，甚至擁有自己的噴射機。"],["mystery","神祕；謎","mysterious a. 神祕的；riddle n. 謎","The reasons behind Dr. Todd’s murder have remained a mystery for many years.","陶德博士遭謀殺的原因多年來一直是個謎。"],["mankind","人類（總稱）","mankind 中的 man 指人類；human being n. 人；humankind n. 人類；benefit from... 從……受益","Television is one of the most popular inventions in the history of mankind.","電視是人類歷史上最普及的發明之一。"],["humankind","人類（總稱）","與 mankind 同義","All humankind will benefit from the scientist’s discovery.","全人類都將從這位科學家的發現中受益。"],["campus","校園","on campus 在校園內；off campus 在校園外","Mary didn’t live on campus while in college. She lived off campus with her aunt and uncle.","瑪麗念大學時沒有住校，她和叔叔、嬸嬸住在校外。"],["scream","尖叫；尖叫聲","shriek vi. 尖叫；shout vi. & n. 喊叫；shout for help 大聲求救；shout at sb 對某人大叫","It is horrible to hear someone screaming in the middle of the night.","半夜聽到有人尖叫是很可怕的。"],["roar","吼叫；咆哮；吼叫聲","roar with laughter 放聲大笑","The roar of a lion can be quite scary.","獅子的吼叫聲可能相當嚇人。"],["yell","大叫；叫喊聲","yell at sb 對某人大叫；let out a yell 發出叫喊；frustration n. 挫折","Dad yelled at me when I made the same mistake again.","我又犯同樣的錯誤時，爸爸對我大吼。"],["harm","傷害；損害","do sb harm = do harm to sb 傷害某人；do sb good 對某人有益；wouldn’t harm / hurt a fly 心地善良、連蒼蠅也不傷害","Smoking will do you great harm. Why don’t you just quit?","抽菸對你有很大的傷害。你為什麼不乾脆戒掉呢？"],["harmful","有害的","be harmful / detrimental to sb / sth 對某人／某物有害；detrimental a. 有害的；extreme n. 極端；carry sth to extremes 把某事做得過火","Anything can be harmful when carried to extremes.","任何事情做得過火都可能有害。"],["budget","預算；編列預算；安排（時間／金錢）","on a tight budget 預算吃緊；budget one’s time / money 安排時間／金錢","We have to carry out the project on a tight budget.","我們必須在預算有限的情況下執行這項計畫。"],["flame","火焰；燃燒；因強烈情緒而發亮","be in flames 著火；flame with envy 嫉妒得兩眼冒火；inflame vt. 使燃燒／激起；fire n. 火；arouse vt. 激起","The barn was already in flames by the time the fire engine arrived.","消防車抵達時，穀倉已經陷入火海。"],["wipe","擦拭；消滅；擦拭","wipe sth out 消滅／徹底摧毀","The waitress wiped the table with a damp cloth.","女服務生用濕布擦桌子。"],["angel","天使","angle n. 角度；角","Helen has a perfect voice and sings just like an angel.","海倫有一副完美的嗓音，唱起歌來就像天使一樣。"],["devil","魔鬼","Speak of the devil, and he shall appear. 說曹操，曹操到。","Stay away from that guy! He is a real devil!","離那個傢伙遠一點！他真是個惡魔！"],["barrel","桶；槍管","barrel 亦可作量詞；storage n. 儲藏","These oak barrels are used for wine storage.","這些橡木桶是用來儲藏葡萄酒的。"],["bucket","水桶","kick the bucket 翹辮子／死掉；be alive and kicking 活蹦亂跳","Can you help me fill these buckets with water?","你可以幫我把這些水桶裝滿水嗎？"],["pail","桶；提桶","pale a. 蒼白的","It took several pails of water to put out the fire.","用了好幾桶水才把火撲滅。"],["clue","線索；提示","do not have a clue = have no idea 一點也不知道；clue to / about / as to... 關於……的線索；whereabouts n. 下落","Do you have any clues to the robber’s whereabouts?","你有任何關於那名搶匪下落的線索嗎？"],["hint","暗示；提示；暗示","take / get a/the hint 領會暗示；hint that... 暗示……；hint at... 暗示……；suggest vt. 暗示／建議","Tammy hoped Steven would take the hint and stop bothering her.","譚米希望史蒂芬能領會暗示，不要再煩她。"],["eager","渴望的；熱切的","be eager to + V = be longing to + V = be dying to + V；be eager for + sth = be longing for + sth = be dying for + sth","Mary is eager to start her new job.","瑪麗迫不及待想開始她的新工作。"],["spin","紡；旋轉；編造；旋轉","spin, spun, spun；spin a story / yarn 編故事；yarn n. 紗線；spin around 旋轉；rotate vt. & vi. 旋轉；reputation n. 名聲","The factory has a reputation for spinning fine wool yarn.","這家工廠以紡製精細羊毛紗線聞名。"],["romantic","浪漫的；不切實際的；浪漫主義者","romance n. 浪漫故事／戀情；impractical a. 不切實際的；dreamy a. 夢幻的；realistic a. 實際的；indulge in... 沉迷於……","Many girls have romantic ideas about becoming a model.","許多女孩對成為模特兒抱有浪漫的想法。"],["passion","熱情；酷愛","have a passion for... 熱愛……；passionate a. 熱情的；stylish a. 時髦的","Amy has passion for clothes. She always wears stylish things.","艾咪熱愛服飾，她總是穿著時髦的衣服。"],["warmth","溫暖","warm a. 溫暖的；make sb’s day 使某人一天都很開心","Seeing Jane smile brings me warmth and makes my day.","看到珍的微笑讓我感到溫暖，也讓我一整天心情愉快。"],["adventure","冒險；冒險經歷","venture n. & vt. & vi. 冒險；Nothing ventured, nothing gained. 不入虎穴，焉得虎子。","That old man often tells us of his many adventures in Africa.","那位老人常告訴我們他在非洲的許多冒險經歷。"],["adventurous","愛冒險的；大膽的","daring a. 大膽的；risk-taking a. 愛冒險的","George is not very adventurous when it comes to food.","說到食物，喬治並不是很勇於嘗試。"],["studio","錄音室；工作室","recording studio 錄音室；warehouse n. 倉庫","This recording studio is fully equipped.","這間錄音室設備齊全。"],["verse","韻文；詩","version n. 版本；versed a. 精通的；be versed in... 精通……","The poet expressed his ideas in verse.","這位詩人以詩表達他的想法。"],["bride","新娘","bridegroom n. 新郎（= groom）","Kent introduced us to his young bride.","肯特把他年輕的新娘介紹給我們。"],["bore","使厭煩；令人厭煩的人／事物","bore sb to death / tears 使某人無聊至極；bored a. 感到厭煩的；boring a. 令人厭煩的；boredom n. 無聊","People who talk too much about themselves bore everyone else.","太常談論自己的人會讓其他人感到厭煩。"],["presence","出席；在場；存在","in the presence of... 當著……的面；present a. 在場的；absence n. 缺席","Your presence is requested at this afternoon’s meeting.","敬請您出席今天下午的會議。"],["doughnut","甜甜圈（= donut）","—","We ate doughnuts for breakfast this morning.","我們今天早上早餐吃甜甜圈。"],["rush","衝；匆忙；熱潮；尖峰時間","rush into... 衝進……；rush out of... 衝出……；be rushed to... 被緊急送往……；in a rush = in a hurry = in haste 匆忙；rush hour 尖峰時間；rash a. 魯莽的","Everyone rushed into the street when a fire broke out.","火災發生時，每個人都衝到街上。"],["bitter","苦的；痛苦的；懷恨的","be bitter about... 對……憤憤不平；bitterly adv. 痛苦地／強烈地；bitterly criticize sb 嚴厲批評某人；bitterness n. 苦味／痛苦","Some Chinese medicines taste quite bitter.","有些中藥嚐起來相當苦。"],["bookcase","書櫃","bookshelf n. 書架","Lisa pulled out a book from her bookcase.","麗莎從書櫃裡抽出一本書。"]],"U14":[["swear","發誓；說髒話","swear, swore, sworn；swear to God that... 對天發誓……；be sworn in as... 宣誓就任……","I swear to God that I didn’t take your pen!","我對天發誓我沒有拿你的筆！"],["parade","遊行；遊行隊伍","be on parade 遊行；march vi. & n. 行進／遊行；be on the march 行進中","Those soldiers were parading in front of the presidential palace.","那些士兵正在總統府前遊行。"],["march","行進；遊行","be on the march 行進中","Thousands of demonstrators marched towards City Hall at 2:00 yesterday afternoon.","數千名示威者昨天下午兩點朝市政府前進。"],["cigarette","香菸","be addicted to cigarettes / smoking 對香菸／吸菸上癮；get addicted to cigarettes / smoking 染上菸癮；tobacco n. 菸草；cigar n. 雪茄","Please put out your cigarette, sir. This is a non-smoking area.","先生，請把香菸熄掉。這裡是禁菸區。"],["plastic","塑膠；塑膠的","a plastic bag 塑膠袋；plastic surgery 整形手術；leather n. 皮革；a leather coat 皮衣；leather boots 皮靴","Bags made of plastic are harmful to the environment.","塑膠製的袋子對環境有害。"],["leather","皮革","a leather coat 皮衣；leather boots 皮靴","Leather coats are back in fashion.","皮衣又流行起來了。"],["float","漂浮；浮板","sink vi. 沉；float on... 漂浮在……上","The first step in learning how to swim is to learn how to float.","學游泳的第一步是學會如何漂浮。"],["pole","桿；竿子；磁極","a fishing pole / rod 釣竿；be poles apart 截然不同；North Pole 北極；South Pole 南極","Place the positive pole of the battery in the toy first and then the negative one.","先把電池的正極放進玩具，再放負極。"],["casual","偶然的；無心的；非正式的（指服裝）","casual wear 休閒服；informal a. 非正式的；formal a. 正式的；casually adv. 偶然地／隨便地","Peter and Bruce’s long friendship began with a casual meeting at a party.","彼得和布魯斯長久的友誼始於一次派對上的偶遇。"],["casually","偶然地；隨便地","—","On weekends, Jenny strolls casually in the park near where I live.","週末時，珍妮會悠閒地在我住家附近的公園散步。"],["doubtful","懷疑的；可疑的","be doubtful about... 對……感到懷疑；doubt n. & vt. 懷疑；without a doubt 毫無疑問；doubtfully adv. 懷疑地；unsure / uncertain / unconvinced a. 不確定的；doubtless a. & adv. 無疑的／必定地","I was doubtful about the old man’s good intentions.","我對那位老人的善意有所懷疑。"],["doubtless","無疑的；必定地","—","Bill has been studying so hard that he will doubtless pass the exam.","比爾一直這麼用功讀書，他無疑會通過考試。"],["stuff","東西（不可數）；填滿","be stuffed with... 塞滿……；stuffy a. 悶熱的／不通風的","Leave your stuff in the car while we check if the hotel has any rooms available.","我們查看旅館是否有空房時，把你的東西留在車上。"],["bare","空的；赤裸的；露出","barehanded a. 赤手空拳的；barefoot / barefooted a. 赤腳的；barely adv. 幾乎不","Our fridge is bare, so we must do some shopping this afternoon.","我們的冰箱空空如也，所以今天下午得去買些東西。"],["barely","幾乎不","hardly / scarcely adv. 幾乎不","Linda is hardly 18 years old and yet has two children.","琳達還不到十八歲，卻已經有兩個孩子。"],["tourist","觀光客；遊客；觀光的","tourist attraction 觀光景點；tour n. 旅行／遊覽；be on a tour of a city 在城市觀光；tourism n. 觀光業","This scenic spot draws tens of thousands of tourists every month.","這個風景區每個月吸引數萬名遊客。"],["tourism","觀光業","—","The country heavily depends on tourism to support its economy.","這個國家高度依賴觀光業來支撐經濟。"],["leap","跳躍；跳","leap, leapt, leapt；by leaps and bounds 突飛猛進；a leap year 閏年；jump vi. & n. 跳","You’d better look before you leap; haste in this case may cause undesired results.","你最好三思而後行；在這種情況下倉促行事可能造成不良結果。"],["fade","褪色；漸弱","fade away 漸漸消失；fade out 淡出；vanish vi. 消失；disappear vi. 消失","General MacArthur once said, “Old soldiers never die; they just fade away.”","麥克阿瑟將軍曾說：「老兵不死，只是逐漸凋零。」"],["vanish","消失","disappear vi. 消失","Many ancient civilizations have vanished mysteriously.","許多古代文明已神祕地消失。"],["cabin","（森林或山中的）小木屋；船艙；機艙","the passenger cabin 客艙；hut n. 小屋","Nobody lives in that log cabin.","沒有人住在那間原木小屋裡。"],["hut","小屋","—","Jim built a wooden hut all by himself.","吉姆獨力蓋了一間木屋。"],["powder","粉末；磨粉","powder one’s face 在臉上撲粉；pill n. 藥丸；tablet n. 藥片／平板電腦","Slowly grind these ingredients into a powder.","慢慢把這些材料磨成粉末。"],["pill","藥丸","—","Judy has to rely on sleeping pills in order to fall asleep.","茱蒂必須靠安眠藥才能入睡。"],["tablet","藥片；平板電腦","take a tablet 服用一顆藥片；tablet computer 平板電腦","The doctor gave me some tablets to help control my frequent headaches.","醫生給了我一些藥片來幫助控制我頻繁的頭痛。"],["deck","甲板","—","Let’s go up on deck and take a look at the night view.","我們到甲板上看看夜景吧。"],["limb","四肢之一","limb n.（樹的）大枝；lose a limb 失去一肢","In that country, many children lost limbs because of stepping on landmines.","在那個國家，許多孩子因踩到地雷而失去四肢。"],["mayor","市長","major n. 少校／主修；county magistrate n. 縣長","My mayor offered his condolences to the victims of the earthquake.","我的市長向地震受害者表達慰問。"],["disk","光碟片（= disc）","a disk drive 光碟機","Jimmy took out a disk and put it into his computer’s disk drive.","吉米拿出一片光碟，放進電腦的光碟機裡。"],["strategy","策略","strategic a. 策略的；strategic weapons 戰略武器","We’re working on new marketing strategies for the product.","我們正在研擬這項產品的新行銷策略。"],["crawl","爬；緩慢的行進","creep vi. 爬行／躡手躡腳地走","A child crawls before it learns to walk.","小孩學會走路之前會先爬。"],["barn","穀倉","hay n. 乾草；hit the hay 上床睡覺；haystack n. 乾草堆","The farmer keeps his cows and horses in the barn.","農夫把牛和馬養在穀倉裡。"],["hay","乾草","hit the hay 上床睡覺；haystack n. 乾草堆","The homeless man was found sleeping on the hay in the barn.","那名遊民被發現睡在穀倉的乾草上。"],["routine","慣例；例行公事；例行公事的","a daily routine 每天的例行公事","Reading English papers in the morning has become part of my daily routine.","早上閱讀英文報紙已成為我日常生活的一部分。"],["carpet","地毯；在……鋪地毯","be carpeted with... 鋪滿……；rug n. 小地毯；cleaner n. 清潔工／清潔劑；cleaner’s / dry cleaner 乾洗店；cooker n. 炊具；rice cooker 電鍋；cupboard n. 碗櫃；hammer n. 鐵鎚；hammer / drive a nail into... 把釘子釘入……","Until the floods hit down the carpet, Mary’s house was beautiful.","在洪水毀壞地毯之前，瑪麗的房子很漂亮。"],["cleaner","清潔工；清潔劑","the dry cleaner’s 乾洗店","My boss was once a street cleaner when he was young.","我老闆年輕時曾是一名街道清潔工。"],["cooker","炊具","a rice cooker 電鍋；cook n. 廚師","Almost every Chinese family has a rice cooker.","幾乎每個華人家庭都有電鍋。"],["cupboard","碗櫃","—","Put these plates on the top shelf of the kitchen cupboard.","把這些盤子放在廚房碗櫃最上層。"],["hammer","鐵鎚","hammer a nail into... = drive a nail into... 把釘子釘入……","I drove the nail into the wall with a hammer.","我用鐵鎚把釘子敲進牆裡。"],["hanger","衣架","—","Dry your clothes on hangers.","把你的衣服晾在衣架上。"],["heater","暖氣機；加熱器","air conditioner n. 冷氣機；fireplace n. 壁爐","We need a heater to keep us warm in winter.","冬天我們需要暖氣機來保暖。"],["broadcast","播送；廣播","cast n. 演員陣容；forecast vt. & n. 預測／預報","The show was broadcast live.","這個節目是現場直播的。"],["brunch","早午餐","brunch = breakfast + lunch","I eat brunch on weekends because I sleep late.","我週末吃早午餐，因為我睡得晚。"]],"U15":[["dislike","不喜歡；厭惡","have a dislike for... 不喜歡……；dislike doing sth 不喜歡做某事；keep a low profile 保持低調","Tanya has a dislike for grapes.","譚雅不喜歡葡萄。"],["patience","耐心","patient a. 有耐心的；be patient with sb 對某人有耐心；impatient a. 不耐煩的；be impatient with sb 對某人不耐煩；impatience n. 不耐煩","Can’t you walk a little faster? I’m losing my patience.","你不能走快一點嗎？我快失去耐心了。"],["bubble","泡泡；冒泡","bubble over = feel excited 興奮不已","There are many bubbles in the bathtub.","浴缸裡有許多泡泡。"],["mushroom","蘑菇；迅速增加","flourish vi. 繁榮／茂盛","Mushroom soup is my favorite.","蘑菇湯是我的最愛。"],["mobile","可移動的；行動的","movable a. 可移動的；mobile phone = cellular phone = cellphone 手機；smartphone 智慧型手機","A business person cannot do without a mobile phone.","商務人士不能沒有手機。"],["nickname","綽號；給……取綽號","pen name 筆名；hammer n. 鐵鎚","Every student in my class has a nickname.","我班上的每位學生都有綽號。"],["vivid","生動的；鮮明的","vividly adv. 生動地；graphic a. 生動的；dull a. 枯燥的／暗淡的","Mary’s description of the party was so vivid that I felt as though I had been there.","瑪麗對派對的描述如此生動，讓我覺得自己彷彿也在現場。"],["lively","活潑的；充滿活力的","energetic / vigorous a. 精力充沛的；feeble a. 虛弱的","A good night’s sleep helped me feel lively again.","一夜好眠讓我又恢復了活力。"],["bury","埋葬；掩埋","bury, buried, buried；bury sb alive 活埋某人；be buried alive 被活埋；be buried in... 埋首於……；burial n. 埋葬","Because of the earthquake, hundreds of people were buried alive.","由於地震，數百人遭到活埋。"],["continent","洲；大陸","continental a. 大陸的；mainland n. 大陸／本土；on the Chinese mainland 在中國大陸；on the European Continent 在歐洲大陸","Australia is a continent; New Zealand isn’t.","澳洲是一個洲；紐西蘭不是。"],["farther","較遠的；更遠地","further a. & adv. 更進一步的／更遠地；until further notice 直到另行通知","You’ll find the bookcase at the farther end of the living room.","你會在客廳較遠的那一端找到書櫃。"],["weep","哭泣","weep, wept, wept；sob vi. 啜泣；mourner n. 哀悼者","The mourners silently wept at the old man’s funeral.","哀悼者在那位老人的葬禮上默默哭泣。"],["ripe","成熟的；時機成熟的","ripen vi. 成熟；mature a. 成熟的；the time is ripe for... 做……的時機成熟","You can’t eat those oranges until they are ripe.","那些柳橙要成熟後才能吃。"],["boot","靴子；踢；啟動（電腦）","a pair of boots 一雙靴子；give sb the boot = fire sb 解雇某人；boot up 啟動電腦；send sb off 把某人罰出場；tardy a. 遲到的","I need to buy a new pair of boots for my hiking trip.","我需要為健行之旅買一雙新靴子。"],["complain","抱怨","complain that... 抱怨……；complain about + N/V-ing 抱怨……；complaint n. 抱怨；make complaints about... = complain about...；grievance n. 不滿／抱怨","Kevin complained that the food was terrible.","凱文抱怨食物很糟。"],["complaint","抱怨","make complaints about... 對……抱怨；appreciate vt. 感激／欣賞","Stop making complaints about life and learn to appreciate what you have.","別再抱怨人生，要學會珍惜你所擁有的。"],["cheek","臉頰；厚臉皮","have the cheek to + V 厚著臉皮做……","The little girl has rosy cheeks and blue eyes.","那個小女孩有紅潤的雙頰和藍色的眼睛。"],["jaw","下巴；顎","escape from the jaws of death 死裡逃生","Your jaw is the lower part of your face below your mouth.","下巴是臉部位於嘴巴下方的部分。"],["chin","下巴","—","Peter has a big chin, but it is hidden under his thick beard.","彼得有個大下巴，但藏在濃密的鬍鬚下。"],["forehead","額頭","brow n. 額頭／眉毛","Helen’s got a large forehead and a pointy chin.","海倫有寬大的額頭和尖下巴。"],["cocktail","雞尾酒","a cocktail party 雞尾酒會","We will host a cocktail party tonight in celebration of John’s birthday.","今晚我們將舉辦雞尾酒會慶祝約翰的生日。"],["bartender","酒保","—","The successful businessman used to work as a bartender while in college.","這位成功的商人在大學時曾當過酒保。"],["pub","酒吧","bar / tavern n. 酒吧；frequent vt. 常去；homey a. 舒適自在的","Many foreigners frequent that pub because of its homey atmosphere.","許多外國人常去那家酒吧，因為那裡有舒適自在的氣氛。"],["wander","漫遊；徘徊","wanderer n. 流浪者；roam vi. 漫遊；wonder vi. 想知道；stroll vi. & n. 散步","The confused old man wandered through the streets, unsure of where he was.","那位迷糊的老人徘徊在街上，不知道自己身在何處。"],["miracle","奇蹟","work / perform miracles 創造奇蹟；miraculous a. 奇蹟般的；wonder n. 奇蹟","It’s a miracle that no one was killed or injured in that accident.","那場事故中沒有人死亡或受傷，真是奇蹟。"],["whip","鞭子；鞭打；攪打","whip, whipped, whipped；lash vt. 鞭打；jockey n. 騎師","The cowboy picked up his hat and whip, and then he went to find the horse.","牛仔拿起帽子和鞭子，然後去找馬。"],["wealthy","富有的","wealth n. 財富；rich / affluent a. 富有的","The wealthy are not necessarily happy; likewise, the poor are not necessarily sad.","富人未必快樂；同樣地，窮人也未必悲傷。"],["poverty","貧窮；缺乏","poor a. 貧窮的；poverty-stricken / impoverished a. 貧困的","The poverty of his family made it impossible for Paul to attend college.","保羅家境貧困，使他無法上大學。"],["drunk","喝醉的；醉漢","get drunk 喝醉；intoxicated a. 喝醉的","Sam got drunk at the party, so I drove him home.","山姆在派對上喝醉了，所以我開車送他回家。"],["lawn","草坪","mow the lawn 割草；lawn mower 割草機","Peter spent all morning helping his father mow the lawn.","彼得花了一整個早上幫父親割草。"],["meadow","草地；牧草地","grassland n. 草原；pasture n. 牧場；graze vi. 吃草","Some sheep were grazing in the meadow.","有些羊正在草地上吃草。"],["weed","雜草；除草","grow like weeds 長得很快","Is this a healthy plant or is it a weed?","這是一株健康的植物，還是雜草？"],["portrait","肖像；畫像","portray vt. 描繪","Mary’s great-grandmother’s portrait still hangs in her father’s house.","瑪麗曾祖母的肖像仍掛在她父親家裡。"],["marble","大理石；彈珠","play marbles 玩彈珠；granite n. 花崗岩","The monument is made of marble and granite.","這座紀念碑是由大理石和花崗岩製成的。"],["bead","珠子","—","I’m making a necklace for my niece using colorful beads.","我正用彩色珠子為姪女做一條項鍊。"],["comma","逗號","be left in a coma 陷入昏迷；coma n. 昏迷","The only mistake was a missing comma in this sentence.","唯一的錯誤是這個句子少了一個逗號。"],["laughter","笑聲","burst into laughter = burst out laughing 突然大笑","Laughter is the best medicine.","笑是最好的良藥。"],["grin","咧嘴笑；露齒笑","grin, grinned, grinned；grin at sb 對某人咧嘴笑；giggle vi. & n. 咯咯笑","Mary grinned at her boyfriend the moment she saw him.","瑪麗一看到男友就對他咧嘴笑。"],["bless","祝福；保佑","be blessed with... 有幸擁有……；blessing n. 祝福","The priest blessed the children as they left.","孩子們離開時，牧師為他們祝福。"],["crash","撞擊聲；墜毀；撞上","a plane crash 空難；crash into... 撞上……；crush vt. 壓碎；clash n. & vi. 衝突；on the spot 當場","While driving through the intersection, we heard a loud crash.","開車通過十字路口時，我們聽到一聲巨響。"],["cruel","殘酷的","be cruel to... 對……殘酷；cruelty n. 殘酷；cruelly adv. 殘酷地；violent / brutal / nasty / unkind a. 殘忍的；kind a. 仁慈的","Children should be taught from an early age not to be cruel to animals.","孩子應從小被教導不要虐待動物。"],["database","資料庫","data n. 資料；information n. 資訊；info n. 資訊；researcher n. 研究人員","The researcher entered the survey results into the database.","研究人員把調查結果輸入資料庫。"],["grassy","長滿草的；多草的","grass n. 草","Eric likes to lie down on grassy fields and watch the clouds float by.","艾瑞克喜歡躺在草地上，看著雲朵飄過。"],["dumpling","餃子；麵糰製食品","—","Would you like some more dumplings?","你還要再吃一些餃子嗎？"],["geography","地理學","geographic = geographical a. 地理的","In high school, my worst subject was geography.","高中時，我最差的科目是地理。"]],"U16":[["amaze","使驚訝","surprise vt. 使驚訝；astonish vt. 使吃驚；astound vt. 使震驚","Joe’s violin-playing skills amazed everyone at the concert.","喬的小提琴演奏技巧讓演奏會上的所有人大吃一驚。"],["amazed","感到驚訝的","be amazed at / by... 對……感到驚訝；be surprised / astonished / astounded at / by...","We were all amazed at Peter’s ability to handle the problem.","我們對彼得處理問題的能力感到驚訝。"],["amazing","令人驚訝的","surprising / astonishing / astounding a. 令人驚訝的","It’s amazing that an ant can carry objects many times heavier than itself.","螞蟻搬得動比自己身體重好幾倍的物體，真令人驚奇。"],["amazement","驚異；驚愕","to one’s amazement 令某人吃驚的是……；surprise / astonishment n. 驚訝","I thought my father would get angry, but to my amazement, he tried to comfort me.","我以為父親會生氣，但令我吃驚的是，他卻試著安慰我。"],["acceptable","可接受的；尚可的","accept vt. 接受；acceptance n. 接受；satisfactory a. 令人滿意的；good enough 還算不錯的；unacceptable a. 不能接受的","The plan we made should be acceptable to them.","我們擬的計畫對他們而言應該是可以接受的。"],["satisfactory","令人滿意的","—","Your performance in the game was acceptable, but it could have been better.","你比賽中的表現勉強可以，但可以更好一點。"],["charm","魅力；符咒；使著迷","be charmed by... = be fascinated by / with... = be attracted by / to...；work like a charm 十分順利；attraction n. 吸引；charisma n. 魅力；fascination n. 魅力","The actor is not very handsome but has great charm.","這名演員不是很帥但是魅力十足。"],["charming","迷人的","attractive / appealing a. 吸引人的","I’m under Jane’s spell because she is so charming.","我對珍著迷，因為她實在太迷人。"],["meaningful","有意義的；意義深長的","mean vt. 意指；meaning n. 意義；significant a. 有意義的／重大的","We had a meaningful and constructive meeting this afternoon.","今天下午我們開了一場有意義且具建設性的會議。"],["meaningless","無意義的；不重要的","insignificant a. 無意義的／不重要的；utterly adv. 完全地","I find this essay utterly meaningless.","我覺得這篇文章完全沒有意義。"],["statue","雕像","sculpture n. 雕像；the Statue of Liberty 自由女神像；erect vt. 豎立","The Statue of Liberty is probably America’s most famous landmark.","自由女神像很可能是美國最知名的地標。"],["living","生計；活著的；現在的","earn / make a living + V-ing 以……維生；earn / make a living as + 職業；live a. 現場的／活的；alive a. 活著的；livelihood n. 生計","Joseph makes a living teaching English.","喬瑟夫以教英文維生。"],["communicate","傳達（意見、感受等）；溝通","communicate with sb 與某人溝通；communication n. 聯絡／傳播；communicative a. 愛交談的","Richard always communicates his ideas clearly.","理查總能清楚地表達他的意見。"],["communicable","可溝通的","stubborn a. 固執的","I have difficulty communicating with a stubborn man like Tony.","我很難跟像東尼那樣固執的人溝通。"],["swell","腫大；膨脹；隆起","swell, swelled, swelled / swollen","The man’s finger swelled after the snake bit it.","該男子的手指被蛇咬後腫了起來。"],["shrink","（使）縮小","shrink, shrank, shrunk；shrink 亦可作名詞，表示精神科醫生","Cotton clothes usually shrink in the dryer.","棉質衣服烘乾後通常會縮小。"],["knight","騎士","betray vt. 背叛","That knight betrayed his country for his lover.","那名騎士為了情人而背叛國家。"],["crown","皇冠；加冕","crown sb king / queen 將某人加冕為國王／王后；be crowned king / queen 被加冕為國王／王后","Queen Elizabeth’s crown is on display in the Jewel House in the Tower of London.","伊麗莎白女王的皇冠在倫敦塔的珠寶屋展示。"],["gang","幫派；成群結隊","gang up against / on sb 因對付某人而成群結隊；gangster n. 幫派分子；clan n. 氏族","Rumor has it that Peter joined a street gang when he was young.","謠傳彼得年輕時曾加入某街頭幫派。"],["mob","一群；暴民；（人群）圍住","mob, mobbed, mobbed；a mob of + 數字 一群為數……的暴民；mobster n. 暴民中的一員","The demonstrators got out of control and became a mob.","那些示威群眾失去控制，變成一群暴民。"],["thread","（縫衣服的）線；頭緒；穿線於","lose the thread of... 理不出……的頭緒；a thread of hope 一線希望；cord n. 有插頭的電線；細繩；rope n. 粗繩","Do you have a needle and thread I can borrow?","你有針和線可以借我嗎？"],["stitch","一針；縫","A stitch in time saves nine. 及時一針可省下九針。","Jack was wounded in a fight and needed 10 stitches.","傑克打架受了傷，需要縫 10 針。"],["explode","爆炸；炸掉；激增","explosion n. 爆炸；爆炸物；explosive a. 爆炸性的 & n. 爆炸物；blow up 炸掉","In 1949, the Soviet Union exploded its first atomic bomb.","1949 年，蘇聯引爆它的第一顆原子彈。"],["horror","恐怖；恐懼","to one’s horror 令某人恐懼的是……；a horror movie 恐怖片；horrify vt. 使恐懼；fear n. 害怕；panic n. 驚恐","To my horror, I realized a stranger was in my house.","嚇壞我的是，我發現家裡有個陌生人。"],["horrible","可怕的；很糟的","terrible a. 可怕的／很糟的","The horrible accident was the worst one we’ve had this year.","這起可怕的意外是今年我們經歷最嚴重的一件。"],["gap","裂縫；歧異","the generation gap 代溝；difference n. 差異；crack n. 裂縫","Because of the generation gap, my mom doesn’t share my interest in this type of music.","因為有代溝，我媽媽並不和我一樣喜歡這類的音樂。"],["fountain","噴泉；噴水池","a fountain machine 飲水機；a fountain pen 鋼筆","Some people throw coins into fountains and make a wish, believing that their wish will come true.","有些人會將銅板丟進池子裡並許個願，他們相信這些願望會成真。"],["youngster","年輕人","young a. 年輕的；youth n. 青年；youthful a. 青春的","More and more youngsters are becoming concerned about the environment.","越來越多的年輕人開始關心環境問題。"],["elderly","年老的","the elderly 老年人；elder n. 年長者／長輩","Please give your seat to elderly passengers on the bus.","在公車上請讓座給年長的乘客。"],["elder","年長者；長輩","one’s elder brother / sister 某人的哥哥／姊姊；one’s older brother / sister","We should learn to respect the elderly.","我們應學習尊重長者。"],["tap","輕拍；輕敲；水龍頭","tap, tapped, tapped；tap water 自來水；tap sb on the + 身體部位 輕拍某人某部位；tab n. 標籤","This tap water is not potable; it’s polluted.","不能飲用這自來水；它被污染了。"],["faucet","水龍頭（美）","turn on / off the faucet 開／關水龍頭；open / close the faucet","I turned on the faucet, but no water came out.","我打開水龍頭，卻沒有水流出來。"],["racial","種族的","racial discrimination 種族歧視；race n. 種族","Racial discrimination is something that shouldn’t be tolerated.","種族歧視不應被容忍。"],["summit","頂峰；頂點","summit talks 高峰會談；the summit of one’s career 某人事業的最高峰；peak n. 山頂／最高峰","The world leaders held summit talks in Manila last month.","上個月各國領袖在馬尼拉舉行高峰會談。"],["follower","擁護者；信徒","follow vt. 追隨；leader n. 領導者","The followers of the church all participated in the annual celebration.","該教會的信徒全都參與這個年度盛典。"],["traveler","旅行者","travel vi. 旅行","Because of her work, Cindy is a frequent traveler to Europe.","因為工作的關係，辛蒂常常到歐洲旅行。"],["champion","得到冠軍者","championship n. 冠軍頭銜；win the championship 贏得冠軍","John was the champion of the contest.","約翰是這次比賽的冠軍。"],["interrupt","打斷","interrupt sb 打斷某人的話；cut in on sb 插嘴；interruption n. 中斷／干擾","Do not interrupt us while we’re talking.","我們在講話時不要插嘴。"],["glow","光輝；發光；（眼睛）發亮","glow with pleasure / pride / passion 散發出愉快／驕傲／熱情的光芒","The oil lamp gives off a soft glow.","油燈散發出柔和的光。"],["ray","光線","X-ray n. X 光；X 光片","The sun’s rays shone through the gap between the walls.","太陽光束從牆壁間的縫隙射進來。"],["beam","播送；廣播；高興地微笑；光束","beam at sb 對某人微笑 = smile at sb；skylight n. 天窗","This program will be beamed to Japan.","本節目將對日本播送。"],["twin","雙胞胎之一；雙生的","Siamese twins 連體嬰","The two girls are twins, but they look nothing alike.","這兩個女孩是雙胞胎，但她們看起來一點也不像。"],["tight","緊的；緊地","keep a tight budget 抓緊預算／節儉過日；loose a. 鬆的","Now that I plan to study abroad, I keep a tight budget.","我既然計畫要出國深造，就要節省使用。"],["tighten","拉緊","tighten one’s grip on sth 緊抓某物；loosen vt. 鬆開","The little girl tightened her grip on her mom’s hand when she saw the dog.","小女孩看到那隻狗時緊抓她媽媽的手。"],["sigh","嘆息","let out a sigh = have a sigh = utter a sigh 嘆一口氣","Olivia let out a sigh of relief when she received a call from her son.","奧莉維亞接到兒子的電話時，放心地歎了口氣。"],["citizen","公民；市民","citizenship n. 公民權；resident n. 居民","Tom is an Australian citizen but grew up in Taiwan.","湯姆是澳洲公民，但卻是在臺灣長大的。"],["holder","保持者；持有人","a record holder 紀錄保持者；set / keep / break a record 創下／保持／破紀錄","Mr. Smith is the current record holder in this game.","史密斯先生是這項比賽目前的紀錄保持者。"],["hunger","渴望；飢餓","hunger for... 渴望……；have a hunger for... = yearn for... = crave for...；hungry a. 飢餓的","After years of war, we all hunger for peace.","經過多年的戰爭，我們都渴望和平。"]],"U17":[["knit","編織","knit, knitted, knitted；sew vt. 縫製","Jenny knitted her son a pair of blue socks.","珍妮替她兒子編織了一雙藍襪子。"],["weave","編織；穿梭；織法","weave, wove, woven；weave one’s way through... 穿梭通過……；weave in and out of traffic 在車陣中穿梭","Alan had to weave his way through the crowd to get to the other end of the mall.","艾倫必須穿過人群才能到達購物中心的另一端。"],["monk","和尚；僧侶","priest n. 牧師／神父；monastery n. 修道院；convert vi. 改信（宗教）","The millionaire converted to Buddhism and became a monk after his wife passed away.","這名百萬富翁在太太過世後改信佛教並出家為僧。"],["nun","修女；尼姑","Sister Maria 瑪利亞修女；volunteer n. 志工","The nun is a volunteer in that hospital.","這位修女是那家醫院的志工。"],["breeze","微風；輕鬆地走","shoot the breeze = chitchat 閒聊；breeze through... 輕鬆通過……；wind n. 風；do nothing but + V 只做……","I felt great as a gentle breeze blew over my face.","當一陣微風吹過我的臉時，我感覺很舒服。"],["mathematical","數學的","a mathematical / math formula 數學公式；mathematics / math n. 數學；mathematician n. 數學家；arithmetic n. 算術","The mathematical formula was named after the great mathematician.","這個數學公式是以這位偉大的數學家命名的。"],["postpone","延後；延期","postpone + N/V-ing；put off + N/V-ing；delay vt. 延遲；postponement n. 延期","Because of the approaching typhoon, we decided to postpone holding the meeting until next Friday.","因為颱風即將來臨，我們決定將會議延至下週五舉行。"],["postponement","延期；延緩","delay n. 延遲","The client seemed unsatisfied with the postponement of the delivery.","客戶似乎對延後交貨感到不滿。"],["emperor","皇帝","empress n. 女皇／皇后；empire n. 帝國","Naruhito became the emperor of Japan on May 1st, 2019.","德仁於 2019 年 5 月 1 日成為日本天皇。"],["feather","羽毛","Birds of a feather flock together. 物以類聚。；fur n.（動物的）毛皮；fur coat 毛皮大衣；conservationist n. 保育人士","After the pillow fight, the two children were covered in feathers.","枕頭大戰後，兩個孩子身上滿是羽毛。"],["wrap","包；裹；披肩","wrap, wrapped, wrapped；wrap (sth) up 包起來／結束；be wrapped up in sth 專心於……","The little girl wrapped some coins in her handkerchief.","小女孩用手帕包了幾枚硬幣。"],["dose","劑量；給……服藥","dosage n.（藥的）劑量；put an animal to sleep 讓動物安樂死","One dose of this medicine will put the dog to sleep.","這種藥只要一劑就能讓這隻狗安樂死。"],["drown","淹沒；溺死","drown one’s sorrows 借酒澆愁；burst one’s banks 河水潰堤","George kept drowning his sorrows after breaking up with Ellen.","喬治和艾倫分手後一直借酒澆愁。"],["bunch","一束；一群","a bunch of... 一束／一群……；bouquet n. 花束","I sent Mary a bunch of flowers, but she didn’t seem delighted.","我送瑪麗一束花，但她看起來並沒有很高興。"],["bundle","一捆；一包；捆起來","a bundle of... 一捆……；bundle up... 把……捆起來；a bundle of nerves 神經緊張的人；typo n. 打字錯誤","Richard gave Judie a bundle of flowers on their first date.","理查在第一次約會時送茱蒂一束花。"],["motel","汽車旅館","hotel n. 飯店；hostel n. 便宜的旅社；inn n. 小旅館；board n. 膳食","When I’m on business, I stay in a motel instead of a hotel because it’s a lot cheaper.","我出差時都會住汽車旅館而不住飯店，因為那便宜多了。"],["suicide","自殺","commit suicide 自殺","It’s shocking that Larry committed suicide. He seemed like a very happy man.","賴瑞自殺的事很令人震驚。他看起來像是個非常快樂的人。"],["mess","混亂；使混亂；胡鬧","be a mess / be in a mess 一團亂；make a mess of... 把……弄得一團亂；mess sth up 搞砸；mess around 胡鬧；messy a. 凌亂的；confusion / chaos n. 混亂","The room is a mess. Clean up before you go.","房間亂七八糟。你先整理好再出門。"],["separation","分離；分開","separate vt. & vi. 分開","Separation from his homeland made the young soldier sad.","離開家鄉使這名年輕士兵感到難過。"],["bush","灌木","beat around the bush 拐彎抹角；shrub n. 灌木","This website provided detailed information on how to plant rose bushes.","這個網站提供如何種植玫瑰灌木的詳細資訊。"],["panic","驚恐；恐慌","panic, panicked, panicked；fear n. & vt. 害怕；fright n. 恐懼；scare n. & vt. 驚嚇","Panic does not help when one is in a dangerous situation.","陷入危險情況時，驚恐是無濟於事的。"],["seal","封條；封住；海豹","seal off... 封鎖……；close vt. 關閉；the Arctic 北極；the Antarctic 南極","Police sealed off all the exits so the bank robbers couldn’t escape.","警方封鎖所有出口，使銀行搶匪無法逃脫。"],["recorder","錄音機；記錄器","record n. 紀錄 & vt. 錄音／錄影；a tape recorder 錄音機；a flight data recorder 飛航資料記錄器（black box 黑盒子）；user-friendly a. 容易使用的","The tape recorder is a user-friendly machine.","這臺錄音機是很容易使用的機器。"],["afterward(s)","之後；後來","thereafter adv. 之後；beforehand adv. 事先；drizzle vi. 下毛毛雨","First, we went to the movies. Afterwards, we went to dinner together.","首先，我們去看電影。之後，我們一起去吃晚餐。"],["ladder","梯子","stair n. 階梯；climb a flight of stairs 爬一段樓梯","Andy fell down the ladder and broke his ankle and wrist.","安迪從梯子上摔下來，摔斷了腳踝和手腕。"],["skip","略過；翹課；跳躍","skip, skipped, skipped；skip class = cut class = play hooky = play truant 翹課；spanking n. 打屁股；jump / hop / leap n. 跳","Jerry skipped lunch in order to get his work done.","傑瑞略過午餐沒吃，以把工作做完。"],["plug","插頭；插入","plug, plugged, plugged；plug sth in 將某物插入插座；socket n. 插座；earplug n. 耳塞；a pair of earplugs 一副耳塞","I need to change the plug on the stereo.","我需要更換音響的插頭。"],["humor","幽默；心情；迎合、寵愛","a sense of humor 幽默感；be in a good / bad humor = be in a good / bad mood 心情好／壞；spoil vt. 寵壞；humorous a. 幽默的","Mark has a great sense of humor.","馬克很有幽默感。"],["humorous","幽默的","personality n. 個性","John is well liked by us because of his humorous personality.","約翰因為幽默的個性而深受我們喜愛。"],["deed","行為；事蹟","behavior n. 行為；do a good deed 做善事；Deeds are more important than empty words. = Actions speak louder than words. 行動勝於空談。","Scouts need to do at least one good deed a day.","童子軍每天至少要做一件善事。"],["stomach","胃；肚子","turn one’s stomach 使某人反胃；stomachache n. 胃痛；belly / tummy n. 肚子；abdomen n. 腹部；belly button / navel n. 肚臍；pot belly 大肚子","The smell of stinky tofu always turns Billy’s stomach.","臭豆腐的味道總是讓比利反胃。"],["misery","痛苦；悲慘","miserable a. 不幸的／令人不快的","The homeless man lives in hunger and misery.","這名遊民生活在飢餓與痛苦之中。"],["fold","摺疊；摺痕","with one’s arms folded 雙臂交叉；unfold vt. 展開；folder n. 文件夾","Fold up the towels like this.","像這樣把毛巾摺起來。"],["punch","一拳；用拳打","land a punch on sth 打中……；punch sb in the face 打某人的臉","That boxer landed a punch on his opponent’s head.","那名拳擊手一拳打中對手的頭。"],["label","標籤；貼標籤；把……稱為","label A as B 把 A 稱為 B；expired a. 過期的","Mom put labels on the medicine bottles so that we could easily distinguish them.","媽媽在藥瓶上貼標籤，以便我們容易辨認。"],["tag","標籤；加標籤","tag, tagged, tagged；a price tag 價格標籤；a name tag 名牌；hashtag n. 主題標籤","The price tag on the package says US$25.","包裝上的價格標籤寫著 25 美元。"],["regret","遺憾；後悔","regret, regretted, regretted；much to one’s regret 令某人很遺憾的是；regret + V-ing 後悔做過……；regret to + V 遺憾要……；regretful a. 後悔的；regrettable a. 令人遺憾的","I regret to tell you that you didn’t meet our requirements.","我很遺憾地告訴你，你沒有達到我們的要求。"],["regretful","後悔的（修飾人）","—","I’m regretful that I made such a mistake.","我很後悔犯了這樣的錯誤。"],["regrettable","令人遺憾的（修飾事）","—","It is regrettable that John failed the test.","約翰考試不及格令人遺憾。"],["jazz","爵士樂","jazz band 爵士樂團","Patrick sang in a jazz band before he became a popular singer.","派屈克在成為流行歌手之前曾在爵士樂團演唱。"],["jeep","吉普車","military jeep 軍用吉普車","A military jeep got stuck in the mud.","一輛軍用吉普車陷在泥沼中。"]],"U18":[["outdoor","戶外的；露天的","outdoors adv. 在戶外；indoor a. 室內的；indoors adv. 在室內","A lot of outdoor activities will take place in the park tomorrow.","明天公園裡將舉辦許多戶外活動。"],["outdoors","在戶外","—","I want to stay outdoors because I enjoy the fresh air.","我想待在戶外，因為我喜歡新鮮空氣。"],["indoor","室內的","—","An indoor flower market is regularly held here on Sunday mornings.","每週日上午這裡都會定期舉辦室內花市。"],["indoors","在室內","—","People must stay indoors for their safety during a typhoon.","颱風期間人們必須待在室內以策安全。"],["bold","大膽的；醒目的","be as bold as brass 厚顏無恥；boldface n. 粗體字","The attempt was bold but reckless as well.","這項嘗試很大膽，但也很魯莽。"],["split","分裂；分開","split, split, split；split up with... 與……分手；split from... 與……分離","Eric split his food out when he saw a cockroach on the dish.","艾瑞克看到盤子裡有蟑螂時，把嘴裡的食物噴了出來。"],["timber","木材；林木","oak n. 橡樹；pine n. 松樹","In this country, over 50 percent of its export earnings come from timber.","在這個國家，超過百分之五十的出口收入來自木材。"],["oak","橡樹","—","This antique table is made of red oak.","這張古董桌是紅橡木製的。"],["pine","松樹","pine away 日漸憔悴","The lumberjacks decided to chop down the old pine trees in the forest.","伐木工決定砍掉森林裡的老松樹。"],["jail","監獄；監禁","be put in jail / prison 入獄；be jailed 被監禁；be imprisoned 被監禁；prison n. 監獄","Alex was put in jail for drug trafficking.","艾力克斯因販毒而入獄。"],["criminal","罪犯；犯罪的","crime n. 罪；criminal law 刑法；convict n. 囚犯","The judge put the criminal in prison.","法官把那名罪犯關進監獄。"],["flavor","味道；風味","flavor with... 以……調味；taste n. 味道 & vi. 嚐起來","Chocolate and vanilla are two different flavors.","巧克力和香草是兩種不同的口味。"],["transport","運輸；運送","transportation n. 運輸；public transportation 大眾運輸","In the past, people used trains to transport coal.","過去人們用火車運送煤。"],["hourly","每小時的；每小時地","on an hourly basis 按小時計；every hour 每小時；weekly a. & adv. 每週的／每週地；monthly a. & adv. 每月的／每月地；quarterly a. & adv. 每季的／每季地","I get an hourly wage of $25 at my job.","我這份工作的時薪是 25 美元。"],["weekly","每週的；每週地","on a weekly basis 每週；every week 每週","The employee’s weekly wage was reduced by 10%.","這名員工的週薪被減少百分之十。"],["monthly","每月的；每月地","on a monthly basis 每月；every month 每月","Roger usually spends his monthly allowance on clothes.","羅傑通常把每月的零用錢花在衣服上。"],["quarterly","每季的；每季地","—","The quarterly meeting is a big event in Jerry’s company.","季會是傑瑞公司裡的一件大事。"],["yearly","每年的；每年地","on a yearly basis 每年；every year 每年；annually adv. 每年地","That publishing company publishes four quizzes every three months.","那家出版社每三個月出版四份測驗。"],["stiff","僵硬的；不自然的","be as stiff as a board 僵硬如木板；stiffen vt. & vi.（使）變僵硬；My neck stiffened after hours of reading.","My legs are stiff from sitting too long at my desk.","我的腿因為在書桌前坐太久而僵硬。"],["rag","破布","from rags to riches 白手起家致富；in rags 衣衫襤褸","I felt sorry for those children in rags.","我很同情那些衣衫襤褸的孩子。"],["rug","小地毯","a rug on the floor 地板上的小地毯","A good rug can add a cozy atmosphere to your living room.","一張好的小地毯可以為你的客廳增添舒適的氣氛。"],["rob","搶劫；剝奪","rob, robbed, robbed；rob A of B 搶走 A 的 B；robbery n. 搶劫；commit robbery 犯搶劫罪；robber n. 搶匪","The blind robber fled all the money he had.","那名盲眼搶匪帶著所有錢逃走了。"],["robbery","搶劫","commit robbery 犯搶劫罪","The young men committed robbery and were put in jail.","那些年輕人犯下搶劫罪而被關進監獄。"],["aboard","在（船、飛機、火車）上；上（船、飛機、火車）","go aboard 上船／飛機；abroad adv. 在國外","We went aboard the ship at 6:00 this morning.","我們今天早上六點登船。"],["athlete","運動員","athlete’s foot 香港腳；athletic a. 運動的；an athletic meet 運動會","An athlete should know the importance of warming up.","運動員應該知道暖身的重要性。"],["ribbon","緞帶；絲帶","tie a ribbon around... 用緞帶繫住……；knot n. 結 & vt. 打結；knotty a. 棘手的","Mom tied a beautiful, purple ribbon around my birthday gift.","媽媽在我的生日禮物上繫了一條漂亮的紫色緞帶。"],["knot","結；打結","tie the knot with sb 與某人結婚","Mary tied the wires together into a knot.","瑪麗把電線打成一個結。"],["tune","曲調；調音","be in tune with... 與……協調；sing in tune 唱準音；be out of tune 走音；melody n. 旋律","The girl was singing out of tune because of stage fright.","那女孩因怯場而唱走音。"],["dim","昏暗的；使昏暗","dim, dimmer, dimmest；bright a. 明亮的","You will hurt your eyes working in such dim light.","在如此昏暗的光線下工作會傷害眼睛。"],["carriage","四輪馬車；車廂","carriage n.（火車的）車廂","I still remember riding in Grandpa’s carriage when I was small.","我仍記得小時候坐祖父馬車的情景。"],["thankful","感謝的；欣慰的","be thankful / grateful to sb for sth 因某事感謝某人；thank vt. 感謝；grateful a. 感激的","I’m really thankful to you for all the support you gave me and my family.","我真的很感謝你給予我和家人的所有支持。"],["brass","黃銅；銅管樂器","copper n. 銅；bronze n. 青銅","The metal frame around the picture was made of brass.","照片周圍的金屬框是黃銅製的。"],["shallow","淺的；膚淺的","superficial a. 膚淺的；deep a. 深的","Kids should play in the shallow end of the pool.","小孩應該在游泳池的淺水區玩。"],["kidney","腎臟","a kidney transplant 腎臟移植；lung n. 肺","John will die if he doesn’t have a kidney transplant soon.","約翰若不趕快接受腎臟移植就會死。"],["lung","肺","lung cancer 肺癌","Kenneth has poor health from smoking cigarettes for many years.","肯尼斯因多年吸菸而健康不佳。"],["saucer","茶碟；飛碟","a flying saucer 飛碟；sauce n. 醬汁；soy sauce 醬油","I spilled the cup of tea on the saucer by accident.","我不小心把杯裡的茶灑在茶碟上。"],["receiver","聽筒；接收器","receive vt. 接收；recipient n. 接受者","The receptionist picked up the telephone receiver and said, “Hello.”","接待員拿起電話聽筒說：「哈囉。」"],["mighty","強大的；巨大的","almighty a. 全能的；God Almighty 全能的上帝；powerful a. 強大的；might n. 力量","The mighty lion roared from the hilltop.","強大的獅子在山頂咆哮。"],["swift","迅速的；迅速地","prompt a. 迅速的；quick a. 快的；rapid a. 迅速的","A swift current carried the boat down the river.","湍急的水流把船沖向下游。"],["approve","贊成；批准","approve of... 贊成……；agree to... 同意……；approval n. 贊成／批准；meet with one’s approval 得到某人贊同","The manager didn’t approve our plan because it was too risky.","經理不贊成我們的計畫，因為風險太高。"],["lightning","閃電","a bolt of lightning 一道閃電；thunder n. 雷","The farmer was struck by lightning but fortunately he survived.","那名農夫遭雷擊，但幸運地活了下來。"],["pitch","瀝青；音高；投（球）；搭（帳篷）","pitch-black a. 漆黑的；pitcher n. 投手；pitch a tent 搭帳篷；high-pitched voice 高音調的聲音","Dad pitched the ball to my sister, and she swung the bat.","爸爸把球投給我妹妹，她揮棒擊球。"]],"U19":[["ash","灰；灰燼","turn to ashes 化為灰燼；ashtray n. 菸灰缸","Mary emptied the ashes in the trash can.","瑪麗把灰燼倒進垃圾桶裡。"],["ashtray","菸灰缸","—","沒有","沒有"],["rumor","謠言；傳聞","Rumor has it that... 據傳……；It is rumored / said that... 據說……；Rumors spread that... 謠傳……","Rumor has it that Gatsby is going to marry a rich widow.","謠傳蓋茲比將娶一位有錢的寡婦。"],["echo","回響；回聲","repeat vt. 重複；reiterate vt. 重申；vague a. 模糊不清的","I heard vague echoes of someone’s footsteps.","我聽到某人模糊的腳步回聲。"],["sweat","流汗；汗","sweat a lot / heavily 大量流汗；sweat like a pig 汗流浹背；No sweat. 沒問題。；break a sweat 開始流汗；perspire vi. 流汗","I sweat a lot on hot days.","大熱天我會流很多汗。"],["perspire","流汗","break a sweat 開始流汗","After jogging for 10 minutes, Jim started to break a sweat.","慢跑 10 分鐘後，吉姆開始流汗了。"],["tub","浴缸；盆","bathtub n. 浴缸（= bath）","My apartment, sadly, does not have a tub.","很遺憾，我的公寓沒有浴缸。"],["peel","果皮；削皮","peeler n. 削皮器","Scientists have discovered that banana peels contain alcohol.","科學家已發現香蕉皮含有酒精。"],["handy","方便的；手邊的","come in handy 派得上用場；gadget n. 小器具","You’d better carry an umbrella with you; it may come in handy.","你最好帶把傘，它可能隨時會派得上用場。"],["handful","一把；少數","a handful of... 一把／少數的……；tuck vt. 塞入","The boy grabbed a handful of berries and tucked them in his pocket.","那男孩抓了一把莓果塞進口袋裡。"],["outline","大綱；輪廓；概述","sketch n. & vt. 草圖／素描；summarize vt. 摘要","Our teacher asked us to write an outline before writing our research papers.","老師要求我們先擬大綱再寫研究報告。"],["tray","托盤","—","The waitress brought the drinks we ordered on a tray.","女服務生用托盤端來我們點的飲料。"],["hasty","匆忙的；草率的","hasten vt. & vi. 加速；haste n. 匆忙；in haste = in a hurry = in a rush 匆忙地；hurried a. 匆忙的；hastily adv. 匆忙地","A hasty decision is often regretted later.","草率的決定往往事後令人後悔。"],["hastily","匆忙地；草率地","in haste = hurriedly 匆忙地","Don’t do things hastily, or you’re likely to make mistakes.","做事不要草率，否則你很可能會犯錯。"],["saving(s)","存款（常用複數）；節省","open a savings account 開儲蓄帳戶；open a checking account 開支票帳戶；earnings n. 收入；income n. 收入；revenue n. 收入／收益","Karen opened a new savings account so she could begin saving for college.","凱倫開了一個新的儲蓄帳戶，好開始為大學存錢。"],["earnings","收入（常用複數）","income / revenue n. 收入；strategy n. 策略","Thanks to our successful marketing strategies, our company’s earnings increased by 20% last quarter.","多虧成功的行銷策略，我們公司的收入上季增加了 20%。"],["deposit","存放（銀行）；押金","withdraw vt. 提領；deposit money in / into a bank account 存款；withdraw money from a bank account 提款","Jason deposits 200 dollars in the bank each month.","傑森每個月在銀行存 200 美元。"],["sincere","誠懇的；真誠的","express one’s sincere thanks / apologies to sb 向某人表達誠摯謝意／歉意；sincerity n. 真誠；insincere a. 不真誠的","John was sincere in his apology, so his mom forgave him.","約翰真心道歉，所以他媽媽原諒了他。"],["inspect","檢查；視察","inspection n. 檢查；examine vt. 檢驗；investigate vt. 調查；inspector n. 檢查員；examiner n. 檢查員；defect n. 缺陷","The police inspected the bloodstains at the crime scene.","警方檢查犯罪現場的血跡。"],["inspector","檢查員","examiner n. 檢查員；defect n. 缺陷","Those inspectors were busy checking our products for defects before shipment.","那些檢查員忙著在出貨前檢查我們的產品是否有瑕疵。"],["spray","噴灑；噴霧","sprinkle vt. 灑；styling spray 定型噴霧","Mary sprayed herself with perfume before going out on a date.","瑪麗在出去約會前噴了香水。"],["lobby","大廳；遊說","lobbyist n. 說客；persuade vt. 說服；proposal n. 提案","Harry and I will meet in the hotel lobby tomorrow morning.","哈利和我明天早上會在飯店大廳碰面。"],["hallway","走廊","passage / corridor n. 通道","The restroom is at the end of the hallway on the right-hand side.","洗手間在走廊盡頭的右手邊。"],["halfway","中途的；在半路上","a halfway house 中途之家；meet sb halfway 與某人各退一步","A halfway house is a place aimed at helping former prisoners turn over a new leaf.","中途之家旨在幫助更生人改過自新。"],["fond","喜好的","be fond of... 喜歡……","Kim is really fond of heavy metal.","金真的很喜歡重金屬樂。"],["harvest","收割；收穫","reap vt. & vi. 收割；farmhand n. 農場工人","The farmers had to harvest the rice before the typhoon came.","農夫們必須在颱風來之前收割稻米。"],["gamble","賭博；冒險","gamble A on B 把 A 賭在 B 上；take a gamble 冒險而為；bet vt. & n. 賭","James loves to gamble by buying lottery tickets each week.","詹姆士喜歡每週買彩券來賭博。"],["sleeve","袖子","have sth up one’s sleeve 留有錦囊妙計；roll up one’s sleeves 捲起袖子","It looks like the boxer is going to lose the fight, but I believe he still has some tricks up his sleeve.","那名拳擊手看來好像快輸了，但我相信他還留了幾手。"],["collar","衣領","white-collar a. 白領階級的；blue-collar a. 藍領階級的；color n. 顏色","Todd grabbed George by the collar and punched him in the face.","陶德抓住喬治的衣領並朝他臉上揍了一拳。"],["truthful","誠實的；真實的","honest a. 誠實的；true a. 真實的；truth n. 真相","You can trust Jim; he is a truthful and upright man.","你可以信任吉姆，他為人誠實又正直。"],["kilometer","公里（長度單位）","亦可寫成 km；meter n. 公尺；centimeter n. 公分","The Great Wall is thousands of kilometers long.","萬里長城長達數千公里。"],["awful","可怕的；很差的","horrible / terrible a. 可怕的／很差的","Denny’s handwriting was so awful that the teacher asked him to rewrite his report.","丹尼的字跡太糟了，所以老師要他重寫報告。"],["discount","打折；折扣","give sb a 20% / 40% discount on sth 給某人某物八折／六折優惠；reduction n. 減價；boutique n. 時裝精品店","Shops discount everything around holidays.","商店會在假日前後大打折扣。"],["drain","排出；排水管","brain drain 人才外流","The water in the bathtub should be drained first.","浴缸的水應該先放掉。"],["pit","坑","hole n. 洞","We dug a pit for the campfire.","為了生營火，我們挖了一個坑。"],["chip","碎片；晶片；削下一小片","chip, chipped, chipped；be a chip off the old block 與父親極為相像","The detective found some chips of wood on the floor.","偵探在地板上發現一些木屑。"],["tug","用力拉；拖","tug, tugged, tugged；tug sb’s arm 拉某人的手臂；tug on / at sb’s sleeve 拉某人的袖子；tugboat n. 拖船；tug-of-war n. 拔河","My girlfriend gently tugged my arm, asking me to give her a kiss.","我女朋友輕輕拉我的手臂，要我親她一下。"],["tug-of-war","拔河比賽","—","My class played against Christine’s in a tug-of-war.","我們班和克莉絲汀她那班比賽拔河。"],["beetle","甲蟲","dragonfly n. 蜻蜓；moth n. 蛾；butterfly n. 蝴蝶；pupa n. 蛹；cocoon n. 繭","My brother keeps a beetle as a pet.","我哥哥養了一隻甲蟲當寵物。"],["dragonfly","蜻蜓","species n. 種類","Different species of dragonflies can be found near the lake.","湖邊可以找到不同種類的蜻蜓。"],["moth","蛾","moth 和 butterfly 屬同一科；pupa n. 蛹；cocoon n. 繭","Can you distinguish between a moth and a butterfly?","你分得出蛾和蝴蝶嗎？"],["apron","圍裙","—","Mother put on her kitchen apron and cooked us a meal.","媽媽穿上廚房圍裙，為我們煮了一頓飯。"],["cock","公雞（= rooster）","cock 亦可作 vt. 翹起；rooster n. 公雞","Cocks usually crow in the early morning.","公雞通常在清晨啼叫。"],["fighter","戰鬥機；鬥士","a jet fighter 噴射戰鬥機；crime fighter 打擊犯罪者","The fighter plane crashed, killing its two pilots.","那架戰鬥機墜毀，造成兩名飛行員死亡。"],["brick","磚塊","a bricklayer 砌磚工人","Tom built a house of bricks.","湯姆蓋了一棟磚造房屋。"],["spaghetti","義大利麵條（不可數）","macaroni n. 通心麵","I ate two plates of spaghetti at the party.","我在派對上吃了兩盤義大利麵。"],["steam","蒸氣；蒸；冒蒸氣","run out of steam 精疲力竭；let / blow off steam 發洩精力／怒氣；steam up sth 使某物蒙上水氣；steamer n. 蒸汽船","Steam engines were developed in the 18th century.","蒸汽引擎在 18 世紀發展出來。"]],"U20":[["import","進口；進口品","import sth to + 地方 將某物進口至某地；import sth from + 地方 從某地進口某物","Most cheeses in that store are imported from France.","那家店的起司大多是從法國進口。"],["export","出口；輸出品","export sth to + 地方 出口某物至某地；export sth from + 地方 從某地出口某物","Cheap toys made in that country are exported to the US in large numbers every year.","由那個國家製造的便宜玩具每年都會大量出口到美國去。"],["tribe","部落","tribal a. 部落的","Each of the tribes has its distinctive tribal traditions and cultures.","每個部落都有其獨特的部落傳統及文化。"],["leisure","閒暇；空閒時間","at one’s leisure = at one’s free time 某人閒暇時間；leisurely a. 從容不迫地 & a. 休閒的；lead / live a leisurely life 過著悠閒的生活","What do you usually do at your leisure?","你空閒時通常做些什麼事？"],["gum","牙齦（複數）；口香糖（不可數）","chewing gum / bubble gum 口香糖","I went to see a dentist for my sore gums.","因為牙齦疼痛，我去看了牙醫。"],["awake","醒來；醒著的","awake, awoke / awaked, awoken / awaked；be awake to sth 了解某事；wake up 醒來","I was raining outside when Dylan awoke.","狄倫醒來時，外面正下著雨。"],["awaken","喚醒；醒來","awaken sb to sth 喚醒某人注意某事；waken vt. & vi. 喚醒／醒來","Bill was woken up by a strange noise in the middle of the night.","比爾半夜被一個奇怪的聲音吵醒。"],["heap","一堆；大量","a heap of... 一堆……","There is a heap of dirty clothes on Jack’s bed.","傑克的床上有一堆髒衣服。"],["ivory","象牙；象牙製的（不可數）；象牙色的","ivories n. 鋼琴鍵；live in an ivory tower 住在象牙塔裡","A gown made of elephant has two long tusks of ivory.","大象有兩根長長的象牙。"],["stubborn","固執的","be as stubborn as a mule 像騾子一樣固執；willful a. 任性的","Jane wanted to try traveling abroad all by herself, but her stubborn parents wouldn’t let her.","珍想嘗試獨自一人出國旅行，但她固執的父母不讓她去。"],["greedy","貪心的；貪婪的","be greedy for... 貪求……；greed n. 貪婪","The young man is greedy for power.","那位年輕人貪求權力。"],["optimistic","樂觀的","optimism n. 樂觀；pessimistic a. 悲觀的；optimist n. 樂觀者","Investors are still relatively optimistic about the company’s prospects.","投資人對該公司的前景仍相對樂觀。"],["rid","擺脫；去除","rid, rid, rid；get rid of sth 擺脫／除去某物","The police chief promised he would do whatever he could to rid the city of crime.","警察局長承諾會盡其所能消除城市的犯罪。"],["moist","潮濕的；濕潤的","damp / humid a. 潮濕的；moist vt. 使潮濕；moisture n. 水分／濕氣","The warm and moist climate here makes it a perfect place for tropical fruits.","這裡溫暖潮濕的氣候使其成為熱帶水果生長的絕佳地方。"],["moisture","水分；濕氣","dampness n. 潮濕","Moisture is taken out of the air by this machine, after which it turns into water.","這臺機器會將空氣中的水分抽出，之後水分會變成水。"],["laundry","洗衣物；洗衣店","do the laundry 洗衣服；do the dishes 洗碗盤","I used to do the laundry once a week when I lived in a dormitory.","我以前住在宿舍時一週洗一次衣服。"],["chill","使冰冷；感到寒冷；寒意","catch a chill 著涼；catch a cold 感冒；a chill of fear 一陣恐懼；chill to the bone 冷入骨髓；chill out 放鬆","I felt the chill in the air when I left home this morning and realized that winter was around the corner.","今天早上離開家時，我感到空氣中的寒意，並意識到冬天快到了。"],["chilly","冷的；寒冷的","cold a. 冷的","It is getting chilly in here. Let’s turn the heater on.","這裡開始變冷了，我們把暖氣打開吧。"],["headline","頭條新聞；標題","be in the headlines 成為頭條新聞；hit the headlines 成為頭條新聞；grab / make the headlines 成為頭條新聞","The financial scandal has been in the headlines for weeks.","這起財務醜聞已連續數週登上頭條新聞。"],["heading","標題；題目","title n. 標題","What’s the heading of that article you mentioned?","你提到的那篇文章標題是什麼？"],["bleed","流血","bleed, bled, bled","After being hit in the face with a volleyball, Tom’s nose kept bleeding.","湯姆的臉被排球打中後，鼻子一直流血。"],["bloody","血淋淋的；血腥的","in blood 流血","Many people consider boxing to be a bloody and violent sport.","許多人認為拳擊是一項血腥且暴力的運動。"],["dash","猛衝；短跑；少量","dash to / for... 衝向……；make a dash for... 衝向……；dash sb’s dreams 粉碎某人的夢想；sprint vi. & n. 短跑","Frank dashed to the toilet as soon as the rain was over.","雨一停，法蘭克就衝向廁所。"],["robe","長袍；浴袍","bathrobe n. 浴袍；dressing gown n. 浴袍","The judge was wearing a black robe.","法官穿著黑色長袍。"],["icy","冰冷的；冰封的","icy cold 冰冷的；ice n. 冰","Be careful! The sidewalk is icy.","小心！人行道結冰了。"],["iced","冰鎮的","iced tea 冰茶","Nothing beats a glass of iced / icy tea on a hot day.","大熱天，沒有什麼比一杯冰茶更棒了。"],["screw","旋緊；螺絲；性交（粗俗用語）","screw A to B 用螺絲將 A 鎖在 B 上；screw up / mess up 搞砸；a screwdriver 螺絲起子；a wrench 扳手；a hammer 鐵鎚","I used strong screws to fix the shelf to the wall.","我用堅固的螺絲把架子固定在牆上。"],["pottery","陶器（集合名詞；不可數）","—","Bill has a fine collection of pottery.","比爾有一批很棒的陶器收藏。"],["porcelain","瓷器（不可數）","—","I bought this porcelain vase at an auction.","我在拍賣會上買了這個瓷器花瓶。"],["vitamin","維他命","Vitamin C 維他命 C","Vitamin C is crucial for healthy gums.","維他命 C 對健康的牙齦非常重要。"],["ache","疼痛；痛處","ache for sth 渴望某物；long for sth 渴望某物；have a headache 頭痛；have a toothache 牙痛；have a backache 背痛；have a stomachache 胃痛","My heart ached when I saw images of flood-stricken refugee camps on TV.","當我在電視上看到遭洪水侵襲的難民營畫面時，我感到心痛。"],["sometime","某個時候","I’ll see you sometime. 有空再見。；sometimes adv. 有時；someday adv. 有朝一日","Let’s meet sometime next week to discuss the details of our plan, all right?","我們下週找個時間見面討論計畫的細節，好嗎？"],["sometimes","有時候","at times / on occasion / occasionally 有時","I call on my grandparents in the country sometimes.","我有時會去鄉下探望祖父母。"],["someday","有朝一日","—","I’m sure my luck will change someday.","我相信總有一天我的運氣會改變。"],["heal","治癒；癒合","cure vt. 治癒","My broken leg is gradually healing, but the doctor said it’ll take me three more weeks to fully recover.","我的斷腿正逐漸癒合，但醫生說還要三個星期才能完全康復。"],["jungle","叢林；密林","a concrete jungle 水泥叢林；forest n. 森林；woods n. 樹林","They said the rebels had a stronghold deep in the jungle.","他們說叛軍在叢林深處有一個據點。"],["pave","鋪（路）","pave the way for... 為……鋪路；pavement n. 人行道／路面；sidewalk n. 人行道","The construction workers were busy paving the road.","建築工人正忙著鋪路。"],["pavement","人行道；路面","sidewalk n. 人行道","David fell from his bike and his head hit the pavement.","大衛從腳踏車上摔下來，頭撞到路面。"],["sword","劍","swordsman n. 劍客","The young man drew his sword and challenged the knight to a duel.","年輕人拔出劍，向騎士提出決鬥。"],["armed","武裝的","be armed with... 以……武裝；armed robbery 持械搶劫；unarmed a. 未武裝的","The bank robber was armed with only a knife.","銀行搶匪只帶著一把刀。"],["canyon","峽谷","a canyon wall 峽谷壁","Have you ever visited the Grand Canyon in Arizona?","你去過亞利桑那州的大峽谷嗎？"],["sprain","扭傷；扭傷","twist vt. 扭傷；wrench vt. 扭傷","Paula tripped on her shoelaces and sprained her ankle.","寶拉被自己的鞋帶絆倒，扭傷了腳踝。"],["dive","跳水；俯衝","dive, dived / dove, dived；dive into... 跳入……；take a dive 跳水；skydive vi. 高空跳傘；skydiving n. 高空跳傘","The boys took off their clothes and dived into the river.","男孩們脫掉衣服，跳進河裡。"],["violet","紫羅蘭；紫羅蘭色的","tulip n. 鬱金香","Violets are my grandmother’s favorite flowers.","紫羅蘭是我祖母最喜愛的花。"],["tulip","鬱金香","—","Tulips are on sale today at the flower shop.","今天花店的鬱金香特價。"]],"U21":[["luggage","行李（不可數）","a piece of luggage 一件行李；two pieces of luggage 兩件行李；a lot of luggage 很多行李；baggage n. 行李（不可數）；claim one’s luggage 領取行李","Don’t forget to claim your luggage before you leave the airport.","離開機場前別忘了領取你的行李。"],["baggage","行李（不可數）","baggage allowance 行李限額；a piece of baggage 一件行李","Be sure to check the baggage allowance for your airline.","務必確認你搭乘航空公司的行李限額。"],["excellence","優秀；卓越","excellent a. 優秀的；excel vi. 勝過；excel in / at... 擅長……；be good at... 擅長……","Professor Burton is well-known for his academic excellence.","波頓教授以其學術上的卓越表現聞名。"],["excellent","優秀的；卓越的","excellence n. 卓越","沒有","沒有"],["excel","勝過；擅長","excel in / at... 擅長……","I’m amazed at Peter’s excellence in Chinese calligraphy.","彼得在中國書法方面的卓越表現令我驚訝。"],["spoil","腐壞；寵壞；破壞","spoil, spoiled / spoilt, spoiled / spoilt；ruin vt. 毀壞；Spare the rod, spoil the child. 玉不琢，不成器。","Food tends to spoil quickly in summer.","食物在夏天往往很快就會腐壞。"],["novelist","小說家","novel n. 小說；an average Joe 平凡人","Ken was just an average Joe until he wrote the book. He is a famous novelist now.","肯原本只是個平凡人，直到他寫了那本書。現在他是位知名小說家。"],["invent","發明；捏造","invent a story = make up a story 捏造故事；invention n. 發明；inventive a. 有創意的；inventor n. 發明家；alibi n. 不在場證明","Some people claim that Bell didn’t invent the telephone.","有些人聲稱貝爾並沒有發明電話。"],["invention","發明；發明物","invent vt. 發明","沒有","沒有"],["inventive","有創意的；善於發明的","invent vt. 發明","沒有","沒有"],["inventor","發明家","invent vt. 發明","Edison was one of the greatest inventors of the twentieth century.","愛迪生是二十世紀最偉大的發明家之一。"],["cheerful","愉快的；開朗的","in a cheerful tone 以愉快的語氣","Ruth can speak in a cheerful tone even when she is really mad.","露絲即使真的很生氣，也能用愉快的語氣說話。"],["gossip","閒話；八卦；說閒話","gossip about... 談論……的八卦；rumor n. 謠言；hearsay n. 傳聞","My friend Ruby always keeps me up to date with the latest gossip about celebrities.","我的朋友露比總會讓我知道名人最新的八卦消息。"],["dump","丟棄；甩掉；垃圾場","dump sb = walk out on sb 甩掉某人；jerk n. 討厭鬼","The police finally found the stolen car, which had been dumped near the beach.","警方最後找到那輛被偷的車，它被丟棄在海灘附近。"],["ditch","溝渠；拋棄","ditch sb = dump sb = walk out on sb 甩掉某人；drain vt. 排水","Farmers use ditches for draining water.","農夫利用溝渠排水。"],["dairy","乳品店；乳製品的","dairies（複數）；dairy products 乳製品；diary n. 日記；keep / write a diary 寫日記","Dairy products, such as cheese and butter, are produced from milk.","乳製品，例如起司和奶油，都是由牛奶製成的。"],["jar","罐子","container n. 容器","I bought a jar of peanut butter at the supermarket.","我在超級市場買了一罐花生醬。"],["sticky","黏的；悶熱潮濕的","stick vt. 黏；sweat like a pig 汗流浹背","I was sweating like a pig because it was hot and sticky.","因為天氣又熱又悶，我汗流浹背。"],["advanced","先進的；高級的；年老的","advance vi. 前進 & vt. 促進；in advance = beforehand 事先；at an advanced age 高齡","This digital camera is the most advanced model on the market.","這臺數位相機是市面上最先進的機型。"],["bacon","培根","bring home the bacon = support one’s family = be responsible for the livelihood of one’s family 養家","A typical English breakfast includes eggs, bacon, sausages, baked beans, and a cup of tea.","典型的英式早餐包括蛋、培根、香腸、焗豆和一杯茶。"],["bait","餌；引誘","take the bait 上鉤；bait sth with... 用……作餌；con artist / con man 騙子","The con artist used a small amount of money as bait to cheat the old man out of all his life savings.","那名騙子用一小筆錢作餌，騙走老人一生的積蓄。"],["beast","野獸；畜生","monster n. 怪物；monstrous a. 巨大的／可怕的","The power of reason is believed to be the chief difference between man and beasts.","理性能力被認為是人類與野獸之間最主要的差別。"],["monster","怪物","monstrous a. 巨大的；可怕的","The witch turned the animal into a monster.","女巫把那隻動物變成了怪物。"],["berry","莓果","strawberry n. 草莓；blueberry n. 藍莓；cranberry n. 蔓越莓；mulberry n. 桑葚；cherry n. 櫻桃","Tom picked some berries from that bush and popped them into his mouth.","湯姆從那叢灌木上摘了一些莓果，塞進嘴裡。"],["cherry","櫻桃；櫻桃色的","cherry lips 櫻桃般紅潤的嘴唇","Mr. Brown grew a cherry tree in his backyard.","布朗先生在後院種了一棵櫻桃樹。"],["best-seller","暢銷書（或商品）","sell like hot cakes 熱賣","The writer’s latest novel has been a best-seller for over 20 weeks.","這位作家的最新小說已暢銷超過二十週。"],["pancake","鬆餅","—","Can I have some of your pancakes? I’m starving.","我可以吃一些你的鬆餅嗎？我快餓死了。"],["jelly","果凍","—","Tonight we’ll have some jelly for dessert.","今晚我們會吃一些果凍當甜點。"],["brake","煞車；煞車","put on / apply the brakes 煞車；windshield n. 擋風玻璃；break vt. 打破 & n. 破裂處","Nicole put on the brakes all of a sudden and my head almost hit the windshield.","妮可突然煞車，我的頭差點撞上擋風玻璃。"],["bud","花苞；發芽","bud, budded, budded；be in bud 含苞待放；nip sth in the bud 防患於未然；nip vt. 掐／夾","The roses in my backyard are in bud.","我後院的玫瑰正含苞待放。"],["yolk","蛋黃","egg white 蛋白","An egg is made up of the yolk and the white.","一顆蛋由蛋黃和蛋白組成。"],["buffet","自助餐；連續猛擊","an all-you-can-eat buffet 吃到飽；be buffeted by... 受到……接連打擊；strike vt. 打擊","It’s an all-you-can-eat buffet, so take whatever you want and pig out!","這是吃到飽自助餐，所以想吃什麼就拿什麼，盡情大吃吧！"],["bump","碰撞；腫塊","bump into sb = run across sb 偶遇某人；bump into sth / sb 撞上……；bumper n. 保險桿；bumpy a. 顛簸的；a bumpy road 顛簸的道路","I bumped into an old friend of mine on the street last night.","昨晚我在街上巧遇一位老朋友。"],["carpenter","木匠","carpentry n. 木工；mason n. 泥水匠；plumber n. 水管工；tailor n. 裁縫；a tailor-made / custom-made suit 訂製西裝；a ready-made suit 成衣西裝","A few carpenters were hired by the government to reconstruct the temple.","政府雇用了幾名木匠重建這座寺廟。"],["tailor","裁縫","tailor-made a. 訂製的；custom-made a. 訂製的；ready-made a. 現成的","The tailor makes the man.","人要衣裝。"],["chat","聊天；閒談","chat, chatted, chatted；chat with sb 與某人聊天；have a chat with sb 與某人聊聊；chat room 聊天室；chat over dinner 邊吃晚餐邊聊天","We had a good time chatting over dinner last night.","昨晚我們邊吃晚餐邊聊天，過得很愉快。"],["chop","砍；劈；肉排","chop, chopped, chopped；get the chop = get the boot = get the sack = be fired 被開除；a pork chop 豬排；a lamb chop 羊排","Workers were busy chopping down trees in the forest.","工人正忙著砍伐森林裡的樹木。"],["slice","薄片；切片","a slice / piece of bread / cheese / pizza / ham 一片麵包／起司／披薩／火腿","Jerry grabbed a slice of bread and then rushed to work.","傑瑞抓了一片麵包，然後匆忙去上班。"],["loaf","一條（麵包）；遊手好閒","loaves（複數）；a loaf of bread 一條麵包；loaf around = play around 閒晃","We bought a loaf of bread at the bakery.","我們在麵包店買了一條麵包。"],["circus","馬戲團","clown n. 小丑；crow n. 烏鴉；crown n. 皇冠","Sammy was so happy when her father promised to take her to the circus on Saturday night.","珊米的父親答應週六晚上帶她去看馬戲團時，她非常高興。"],["clown","小丑","—","The funny clown made all of the children happy.","那個有趣的小丑逗得所有孩子都很開心。"],["clinic","診所","a dental clinic 牙科診所","Have you made an appointment with the local clinic?","你已經和當地診所預約了嗎？"],["stool","凳子；糞便","couch n. 長沙發","Roger sat on the bar stool drinking beer and talking to the bartender.","羅傑坐在酒吧高腳凳上喝啤酒，和酒保聊天。"],["zipper","拉鍊；拉上拉鍊","zipper = zip；junk n. 垃圾／破爛貨；zip up a coat 拉上外套拉鍊","The zipper of the jacket I just bought is not working. What a piece of junk!","我剛買的夾克拉鍊壞了。真是個破爛貨！"],["zip","拉上拉鍊","zip, zipped, zipped；zip up... 拉上……的拉鍊","Can you help me zip up my dress?","你可以幫我把洋裝的拉鍊拉上嗎？"],["cable","纜線；有線電視","a cable car 纜車；cable TV 有線電視","We have to pay to watch cable TV.","我們必須付費才能看有線電視。"],["cart","手推車；馬車","put the cart before the horse 本末倒置；horse-drawn cart 馬車","The cart was full of fruit and vegetables.","手推車裡裝滿了水果和蔬菜。"]],"U22":[["bravery","勇敢","brave a. 勇敢的；courage n. 勇氣；cowardice n. 膽怯","Peter’s bravery and loyalty led him to complete the mission.","彼得的勇敢和忠誠使他完成了任務。"],["cradle","搖籃；抱在懷中","from the cradle to grave 從出生到死亡；cradle... in one’s arms 把……抱在懷中；embrace vt. 擁抱","Thanks to the sound welfare system, everyone in this country is well taken care of from the cradle to grave.","多虧健全的福利制度，這個國家的每個人從出生到死亡都受到妥善照顧。"],["dam","水壩；築壩","dam, dammed, dammed；reservoir n. 水庫","The government is building a dam in that river, but environmentalists are very against it.","政府正在那條河上興建水壩，但環保人士非常反對。"],["darling","親愛的人；親愛的","darling n. 親愛的人；honey n. 親愛的","Oh my darling! How I have missed you!","喔，我親愛的！我好想你！"],["deepen","加深；深化","deep a. 深的；deeply adv. 深深地；depth n. 深度；in depth 深入地；lengthen / shorten / widen / broaden","The expert suggested that we deepen the river to prevent flooding.","專家建議我們加深河道以防止洪水。"],["dime","一角硬幣","be a dime a dozen 很普通／不值錢；dime store 廉價商店；penny n. 一分；pence n. penny 的複數；penny-pinching a. 小氣的","A dime is worth one tenth of a United States dollar.","一角硬幣等於十分之一美元。"],["dip","浸；下降；蘸醬","dip, dipped, dipped；dip in / into... 浸入……；take a dip 游泳；skinny-dip 裸泳；dipstick n. 機油尺","Mary dipped her handkerchief in soapy water and gently washed it.","瑪麗把手帕浸入肥皂水中，輕輕地洗。"],["arrest","逮捕","be under arrest 被逮捕；be under house arrest 被軟禁","“Freeze! You’re under arrest!” shouted the policeman.","「不准動！你被捕了！」警察喊道。"],["erase","擦掉；消除","erase sth from one’s mind 從腦中抹去；eraser n. 橡皮擦；indelible a. 擦不掉的","John helped his teacher erase the blackboard after class.","約翰下課後幫老師擦黑板。"],["fancy","喜愛；想要；花俏的","fancy + V-ing 想要……；fancy dress 華麗服裝；take a fancy to... 喜歡上……；imagination n. 想像力","Tom has a fancy for spicy Mexican food.","湯姆喜愛辛辣的墨西哥食物。"],["fare","車資；票價","fee n. 費用；farewell n. 告別；the bus / train fare 公車／火車票價","How much is the bus fare from New York to Washington D.C.?","從紐約到華盛頓特區的公車票價是多少？"],["flock","群；成群而行","a flock of sheep / goats 一群羊／山羊；flock of people 一群人；come in flocks 成群而來","I saw a flock of sheep on the hillside.","我在山坡上看到一群羊。"],["pint","品脫","quart n. 夸脫；gallon n. 加侖","Joe accidentally spilled about 10 pints of cream on the ground.","喬不小心把大約十品脫的鮮奶油灑在地上。"],["gasoline","汽油（不可數）","gasoline / gas / petrol 汽油；petroleum n. 石油；gas station 加油站；petrol station 加油站","Mike ran out of gasoline while in the middle of nowhere.","麥克在荒郊野外時汽油用完了。"],["grocery","食品雜貨店；食品雜貨","groceries n. 食品雜貨；grocery store 食品雜貨店","I need to pick up some groceries on my way home.","我回家途中需要買些食品雜貨。"],["stadium","體育場","gymnasium / gym n. 體育館","The concert will be held in a large stadium.","演唱會將在一座大型體育場舉行。"],["helmet","安全帽；頭盔","wear a helmet 戴安全帽","Always wear a helmet when you ride a motorcycle.","騎機車時一定要戴安全帽。"],["hometown","家鄉","homeland n. 祖國／家鄉","William Shakespeare’s memorial is located in his hometown.","莎士比亞的紀念館位於他的家鄉。"],["honesty","誠實","honest a. 誠實的；dishonestly adv. 不誠實地；Honesty is the best policy. 誠實為上策","John has won my respect not because of his competence but because of his honesty.","約翰贏得我的尊敬不是因為他的能力，而是因為他的誠實。"],["jewel","寶石；珠寶","gem n. 寶石；jewelry n. 珠寶（不可數）","The billionaire keeps most of his jewels in the bank lest they should be stolen.","那位億萬富翁把大部分珠寶存放在銀行，以免遭竊。"],["junk","垃圾；破爛貨；丟棄","junk food 垃圾食物；junkyard n. 廢車場／垃圾場","That bicycle I bought yesterday is really a piece of junk.","我昨天買的那輛腳踏車真是個破爛貨。"],["litter","垃圾；亂丟垃圾","a litter of... 一窩……；litter sth with... 使某處散布……；litterbug n. 亂丟垃圾的人；a litterbag 垃圾袋","After the fair, litter was everywhere.","市集結束後，到處都是垃圾。"],["lifetime","一生；終生","a chance of a lifetime 千載難逢的機會；in one’s lifetime 在某人一生中；lifelong a. 終生的","For Tommy, going on a trip to India was a chance of a lifetime.","對湯米而言，去印度旅行是千載難逢的機會。"],["mall","大型購物中心","shopping mall 購物中心","I usually hang out at the mall with friends on weekends.","我週末通常和朋友在購物中心閒逛。"],["marvelous","極好的；令人驚嘆的","marvel n. 奇蹟 & vi. 驚嘆；marvel at... 對……驚嘆；wonderful a. 極好的","John is famous for his marvelous achievements in computer science.","約翰以他在電腦科學方面的傑出成就聞名。"],["merry","愉快的；歡樂的","Merry Christmas! 聖誕快樂！；cheerful a. 愉快的","The park was full of smiling parents and merry children.","公園裡滿是面帶笑容的父母和歡樂的孩子。"],["queer","奇怪的；古怪的","strange / odd / weird a. 奇怪的","Last night, I heard a queer noise coming from the basement.","昨晚，我聽到地下室傳來奇怪的聲音。"],["voter","選民","vote vi. & vt. 投票；ballot n. 選票","The voters lined up at the polling station to give the ballots.","選民在投票所排隊投票。"],["underwear","內衣（不可數）","—","When Jack opened his suitcase, he realized that he’d forgotten to pack his underwear.","傑克打開行李箱時，才發現忘了帶內衣。"],["trumpet","小號；喇叭","blow one’s own trumpet / horn 自吹自擂；trumpeter n. 小號手","The young man seemed to keep blowing his own trumpet in the interview.","那名年輕人在面試中似乎一直自吹自擂。"],["tower","塔","—","The tower is about 100 meters high.","這座塔大約一百公尺高。"],["tangerine","橘子","pineapple n. 鳳梨；melon n. 瓜；cantaloupe n. 哈密瓜；lemonade n. 檸檬水","What is the difference between an orange and a tangerine?","柳橙和橘子有什麼不同？"],["surround","包圍；環繞","be surrounded with / by... 被……包圍；surroundings n. 環境（複數）","All the classmates surrounded Tom, praising him for his musical talent at the concert.","所有同學都圍著湯姆，稱讚他在音樂會上的音樂才華。"],["snap","折斷；啪地關上；快照","snap, snapped, snapped；snap one’s fingers 彈指；snap at sb 厲聲斥責某人；snappy a. 俐落的；make snappy 快一點；hurry up 趕快","I usually snap the lid shut to stop your fingers at a time.","我通常會啪地把蓋子關上。"]],"U23":[["microphone","麥克風（= mike）","a wireless microphone 無線麥克風；wireless a. 無線的","Speak into the microphone so everyone can hear you.","對著麥克風講話這樣大家才可以聽得到。"],["microwave","微波爐 & 以微波爐烹調","microwave oven 才是「微波爐」正式的說法，但現今許多英美人士均將微波爐簡稱為 a microwave；oven n. 烤箱，烤爐；reheat vt. 再加熱","Reheat the pizza in the microwave oven for two minutes.","把比薩放到微波爐再加熱兩分鐘。"],["nap","打瞌睡 & 打盹；小睡","nap, napped, napped；take a nap = take a siesta 小睡一會；siesta n. 小睡（西班牙語，已為英美人士使用）；snap vi. & n. 突然折斷","Grandfather napped in the armchair while the TV was still on.","爺爺在單人座沙發上打起瞌睡，而電視還開著。"],["necktie","領帶","wear a necktie / tie 繫領帶","You are required to wear a necktie if you want to get into that restaurant.","要進入那間餐廳，你得繫領帶才行。"],["blouse","（女用）罩衫；短衫","shirt n.（男用）襯衫","Alice looks absolutely stunning in that blouse.","穿著那件罩衫的艾麗絲看起來美極了。"],["vest","背心","vest 可指搭配西裝穿著的無袖厚背心，亦可指室內衣的無袖汗衫","You can buy a vest to match your new shirt.","你可以買件背心搭配你這件新的襯衫。"],["pal","夥伴；哥兒們（口語）","companion n. 同伴（正式）；buddy n. 老兄／哥兒們（口語）；a pen pal 筆友","Hey, pal! Want to go see a movie?","嘿，哥兒們，想不想去看場電影？"],["parcel","包裹（英）& 分配（與介詞 out 並用）","package n. 包裹（美）；charity n. 慈善機構","Please take this parcel to the post office and have it sent immediately.","請把這個包裹拿到郵局立刻把它寄掉。"],["passport","護照","visa n. 簽證；customs n. 海關（恆用複數）；go through customs 通關／通過出入境檢查過程","You have to present your passport as you go through customs.","你出入海關必須出示護照。"],["pity","同情；可惜；遺憾 & vt.","同情；憐憫","pity, pitied, pitied；take / have pity on sb 同情某人；It is a pity that... 很遺憾……；It is too bad that...；It is a shame that...；pitiful a. 可憐的；pitiless a. 無憐憫心的／無情的；sympathy n. 同情／憐憫","Mr. Green took pity on me and let me postpone my presentation until Friday."],["pollute","汙染","pollutant n. 汙染物；asthma n. 氣喘病","The exhaust from our cars pollutes the air and causes asthma in children.","我們汽車排放的廢氣會汙染空氣，使幼童罹患氣喘。"],["pollution","汙染（不可數）","air / noise / water pollution 空氣／噪音／水汙染；pollute vt. 汙染；pollutant n. 汙染物","Pollution control has become one of the country’s major concerns.","汙染防制已成為該國關切的主要議題之一。"],["rot","使腐敗 & 腐化 & vi. 腐朽；腐敗","rot, rotted, rotted；decay vt. 使蛀 & vi. 腐爛；weaken vt. 使衰弱","Sweets will rot your teeth if you eat too many of them.","如果你吃太多甜食，可是會蛀牙的。"],["rotten","腐敗的；貪腐的","One rotten apple spoils the barrel. 一粒老鼠屎壞了一鍋粥。；barrel n.（中間鼓起的）木製大圓桶","The smell of rotten food disgusts me.","腐敗的食物味道令我作嘔。"],["rust","鏽 & vi.","使生鏽 & vi. 生鏽；荒廢","rusty a. 生鏽的；corrode vt. 腐蝕；corrosion n. 腐蝕；erode vt. 腐蝕；erosion n. 腐蝕；be covered in / with... 被……覆蓋","The old bike is covered with a lot of rust."],["sack","大袋子","hit the sack 睡覺（口語）= hit the hay = turn in（口語）= go to bed（正式）；get the sack = be sacked = be fired 被開除","I’m so tired that I think I’ll just hit the sack.","我好累，所以我想乾脆去睡覺。"],["shampoo","洗髮精（物質名詞，不可數）& vt.","用洗髮精洗髮","conditioner n. 潤絲精（物質名詞，不可數）；dandruff n. 頭皮屑","You should buy a special kind of shampoo for your damaged hair."],["shepherd","牧羊人","a shepherd dog 牧羊犬","The young shepherd led a flock of sheep up the hill.","那個年輕的牧羊人把一群羊帶到山坡上。"],["slippery","滑溜溜的","slip vi. 滑倒；slipper n. 拖鞋","Be careful! The sidewalk is slippery.","小心！人行道很滑。"],["sorrow","悲傷","sorrowful a. 悲傷的；sorry a. 難過的；grief n. 悲痛／悲傷","To our great sorrow, the doctor said Edward has only another five months to live.","令我們很難過的是，醫生說愛德華只剩五個月可活。"],["spy","間諜 & vi.","偵察（與介詞 on 並用）","spy, spied, spied；spy on sb 監視某人；detective n. 偵探／刑警","The spy was caught providing information to the enemy."],["scout","偵察；尋找 & n. 童子軍","search vi. 尋找（與 for 並用）；scout for... 尋找…… = search for...；a boy scout 男童軍；a girl scout 女童軍；deed n. 行為","I’m scouting around for a school that has a good English learning program.","我在找尋有優良英語學習課程的學校。"],["tease","揶揄","tease sb = laugh at sb = make fun of sb = pull sb’s leg 愚弄某人（非「扯某人後腿」）","I couldn’t help getting angry when I found out John was teasing me.","我發現約翰在揶揄我時，就忍不住生氣了。"],["tender","溫柔的；（年紀）稚嫩的","at the tender age of + 年齡 以……歲的稚齡；gentle a. 溫和的","The tender look my mother gave made me smile.","我媽媽溫柔的眼神讓我笑了。"],["trunk","樹幹；（汽車）後行李箱；象鼻","bough n. 大樹枝；branch n. 中樹枝；twig n. 小樹枝／嫩枝；複數形 trunks 可指籃球員或游泳選手穿的運動褲；a pair of trunks 一件短運動褲；a first-aid kit 急救箱；flexible a. 有彈性的","Some mountain climbers like to carve their names on tree trunks.","有些登山客喜歡把自己的名字刻在樹幹上。"],["tutor","家庭教師 & vt.","教導；給……當家庭教師","private tutor 私人家庭教師；tutor junior high school students 教導國中生","John’s parents are looking for a private tutor to help him with his English."],["wax","蠟 & vt.","打蠟","styling wax 髮蠟；earwax n. 耳屎（不可數）","Wax will become liquid when it is heated."],["web","全球資訊網（字首大寫）（= the World Wide Web）；蜘蛛網","net n. 網際網路（字首大寫）（= the internet）；website n. 網站；internet n. 網際網路；prey n. 獵物（集合名詞，不可數）","Nowadays you can find almost anything you’d like to know on the Web.","現今你幾乎可在全球資訊網／網際網路上找到所有你想知道的東西。"],["bulb","電燈泡（= light bulb）","a lamp 一盞燈（含燈泡及燈罩）；creepy a. 令人毛骨悚然的","This light bulb gives off purple light, which is creepy.","這個燈泡會發出紫色的光，令人毛骨悚然。"],["mist","薄霧 & vt.","使蒙上薄霧（與介詞 up 並用）","misty a. 陰霧的／模糊不清的；fog n. 厚霧；foggy a. 起大霧的；frost n. 霜；smog n. 煙霧；kettle n.（煮開水用的）水壺","Because of the mist, we didn’t have a clear view of the mountains."],["organic","有機的","organ n. 器官；organism n. 生物／有機體","More and more people are eating organic food for the sake of their health.","為了健康的緣故，吃有機食物的人越來越多了。"],["palm","手掌；棕櫚（樹）","palm reading 看手相；read sb’s palms 看某人的手相；fist n. 拳","John gripped the coins tightly in his palm.","約翰把這些錢幣緊緊地握在掌中。"],["pat","輕拍","pat, patted, patted；pat sb on the + 身體部位 拍某人的……；pat sb on the back = give sb a pat on the back 鼓勵某人；tap vt. 輕拍／輕敲","Stop patting me on the head. I have had enough of it.","別再拍我的頭，我受夠了。"],["learning","學識（不可數）","learn vi. 學習；learned a. 學問淵博的；knowledge n. 知識","Professor Koss is a man of great learning.","寇斯教授是一個博學的人。"],["kingdom","王國","king n. 國王／君主；empire n. 帝國；the United Kingdom 大英聯合王國","The king ruled the kingdom for 50 years.","那位國王統治那個王國有五十年之久。"],["industrial","工業的","industry n. 工業；industrious a. 勤奮的；diligent a. 勤奮的；industrialize vt. & vi.（使）工業化；industrialist n. 企業家／實業家；the Industrial Revolution 工業革命；agricultural a. 農業的","That area of the country is industrial rather than agricultural.","該國那個地區是工業區而非農業區。"],["humid","溼氣重的","humidity n. 溼氣／溼度；damp a. 潮溼的；moist a. 潮溼的","In the summer, the weather is generally hot and humid.","夏季時，天氣通常又熱又潮溼。"],["rectangle","長方形","rectangular a. 長方形的；square n. 正方形；circle n. 圓形；triangle n. 三角形；diamond n. 菱形","The table is in the shape of a rectangle.","這個餐桌是長方形的。"],["scarce","稀少的","scarcely adv. 幾乎不；scarcity n. 稀罕／缺乏","Natural resources, such as timber and oil, are becoming scarce.","像木材和石油等這類的天然資源正日漸稀少。"],["silk","絲","silky a. 像絲一樣的","Jessica wore a blue silk dress to the wedding party.","潔西卡穿一件藍色絲質洋裝參加結婚派對。"],["slope","斜坡；山坡","a steep slope 陡坡；a gentle slope 緩坡","It is difficult to ride a small motorcycle up a steep slope.","沿著陡坡騎摩托車是很困難的一件事。"],["swan","天鵝","—","To everyone’s surprise, the ugly duckling has grown up into a beautiful swan.","令大家驚奇的是，那隻醜小鴨已經長大變成了一隻漂亮的天鵝。"],["log","圓木 & vt.","伐（木）；砍（樹）","log, logged, logged；sleep like a log 睡得很沉；woods n. 樹林；timber n. 木材（= lumber）","Dad slept like a log and I couldn’t wake him up."]],"U24":[["chimney","煙囪","smoke like a chimney 菸抽得很兇","Charlie smoked like a chimney all night, worrying about his missing daughter.","查理整晚不停抽菸，擔心他失蹤的女兒。"],["clip","夾子；夾住；修剪","clip, clipped, clipped；paper clip 迴紋針；stationery n. 文具；tack n. 圖釘 & vt. 釘住","I need some clips to hold these papers together.","我需要一些夾子把這些紙夾在一起。"],["stationery","文具（不可數）","office stationery 辦公文具","We need more office stationery for our work.","我們工作需要更多辦公文具。"],["tack","圖釘；釘住","press a tack / thumbtack to the wall 把圖釘按入牆上","Jack used a tack to fix the note onto the bulletin board.","傑克用圖釘把便條固定在布告欄上。"],["countable","可數的","countless a. 無數的；uncountable a. 不可數的","The word dog is a countable noun, whereas the word water is an uncountable noun.","dog 這個字是可數名詞，而 water 這個字是不可數名詞。"],["uncountable","不可數的","countable a. 可數的","The word dog is a countable noun, whereas the word water is an uncountable noun.","dog 這個字是可數名詞，而 water 這個字是不可數名詞。"],["dearly","非常；深深地；昂貴地","cost sb dearly 使某人付出慘痛代價；greatly / deeply adv. 非常／深深地","Henry loves his family dearly. He’s willing to do anything for them.","亨利深愛他的家人。他願意為他們做任何事。"],["greatly","非常；大大地","deeply / dearly adv. 深深地","John’s arrogance and laziness cost him dearly; he has no job, nor does he have any friends.","約翰的傲慢與懶惰使他付出慘痛代價；他沒有工作，也沒有朋友。"],["energetic","精力充沛的","energy n. 精力；dynamic a. 有活力的；persistent a. 堅持不懈的","Modern women are energetic, ambitious and, most of all, persistent in the pursuit of their goals.","現代女性精力充沛、有企圖心，而且最重要的是，會堅持不懈地追求目標。"],["fairy","仙女；小精靈","fairies（複數）；fairy tale 童話；folklore n. 民間傳說；tiny a. 極小的","Fairies are often described in folklore as tiny, mysterious creatures.","在民間傳說中，仙女常被描述成神祕的小生物。"],["fireworks","煙火（複數）","set off fireworks 放煙火；firecracker n. 鞭炮；set off firecrackers 放鞭炮","Last night’s fireworks were really impressive.","昨晚的煙火真的令人印象深刻。"],["greenhouse","溫室","the greenhouse effect 溫室效應","The greenhouse effect is raising ocean temperatures worldwide.","溫室效應正使全球海洋溫度上升。"],["lighthouse","燈塔","cast vt. 投射","The lighthouse cast a light onto the sea to guide the ships.","燈塔把光投向海面以引導船隻。"],["housekeeper","管家；女傭","housewife n. 家庭主婦；butler n. 男管家","Since you are so busy, you should hire a housekeeper to take care of your house.","既然你這麼忙，你應該雇一名管家照料房子。"],["hairdresser","美髮師","haircut n. 理髮；get a haircut 理髮；hairdo / hairstyle n. 髮型；barbershop n. 理髮店；barber n. 理髮師；beauty parlor / hair salon 美髮院","A hairdresser is one whose job is to cut, style, and color people’s hair.","美髮師的工作是替人剪髮、做造型及染髮。"],["hatch","孵化；策劃；艙口","hatches（複數）；hatch a plan / plot 策劃計畫／陰謀；Don’t count your chickens before they hatch. 別高興得太早。","The hen is sitting on the eggs waiting for them to hatch.","母雞正坐在蛋上等著牠們孵化。"],["hug","擁抱","hug, hugged, hugged；give sb a big / warm hug 給某人一個大大的／溫暖的擁抱；embrace n. & vt. 擁抱","John gave his girlfriend a big hug when they met at the airport.","約翰和女朋友在機場見面時，給了她一個大大的擁抱。"],["kangaroo","袋鼠","kangaroos（複數）；koala n. 無尾熊","Many tourists have been attacked by wild kangaroos recently.","最近有許多遊客遭到野生袋鼠攻擊。"],["keyboard","鍵盤；電子琴","a computer keyboard 電腦鍵盤；an electronic keyboard 電子琴；wrist n. 手腕；strain n. 拉傷／壓力","This computer keyboard is designed to reduce wrist strain.","這個電腦鍵盤的設計是為了減少手腕的負擔。"],["kit","成套工具；配備","a first-aid kit 急救箱；a tool kit 工具箱；handy a. 手邊可用的","When you’re at home, it’s always a good idea to have a first-aid kit handy in case of emergency.","在家時，最好隨手備有急救箱，以防緊急狀況。"],["lace","蕾絲；鞋帶；用帶子繫緊","be trimmed with lace 以蕾絲裝飾；a pair of shoelaces 一雙鞋帶；undone a. 鬆開的","Peggy’s wearing a beautiful evening gown which is trimmed with black lace.","佩姬穿著一件以黑色蕾絲裝飾的漂亮晚禮服。"],["leak","漏；洩漏；漏洞","leaky a. 漏的；a gas leak 瓦斯洩漏","Oil was leaking out of the truck.","油正從卡車漏出來。"],["scrub","用力擦洗；擦洗","scrub, scrubbed, scrubbed；give the floor / table a good scrub 好好擦洗地板／桌子；mop vt. 拖地","Julie was busy scrubbing the floor while her husband prepared dinner.","茱莉忙著刷洗地板，而她的丈夫在準備晚餐。"],["scarf","圍巾","scarfs / scarves（複數）","The scarf you’re wearing looks great. Where did you get it?","你戴的這條圍巾很好看。你在哪裡買的？"],["pearl","珍珠","a string of pearls 一串珍珠；cast pearls before swine 明珠暗投／對牛彈琴；pearly a. 珍珠般的","I bought this pearl necklace at a bargain price.","我以便宜的價格買了這條珍珠項鍊。"],["pearly","珍珠般的；珍珠色的","pearly white teeth 潔白如珍珠的牙齒","Susan has pearly white teeth.","蘇珊有一口珍珠般潔白的牙齒。"],["poster","海報","put up a poster 張貼海報","Mary put up a poster of Madonna on the wall.","瑪麗在牆上貼了一張瑪丹娜的海報。"],["sausage","香腸","—","This restaurant is famous for its German sausages and beer.","這家餐廳以德國香腸和啤酒聞名。"],["shovel","鏟子；用鏟子鏟","shove vt. 推；shove sb out of the way 把某人推開；spade n. 鏟子","John used a shovel to shovel the snow away from his front door.","約翰用鏟子把前門的雪鏟走。"],["spice","香料；給……加香料；增添趣味","spicy a. 辛辣的；spice up... 為……增添趣味；cinnamon n. 肉桂；Variety is the spice of life. 變化是生活的調味料。","The chef told Peter that he could add some spicy sauce to the food.","主廚告訴彼得，他可以在食物中加一些辣醬。"],["starve","使挨餓；挨餓","be starving / starved to death 餓死；starvation n. 飢餓","All the prisoners of war here have been starved and ill treated.","這裡所有戰俘都挨餓並受到虐待。"],["sting","螫；刺痛；螫傷","sting, stung, stung；stinger n. 螫針","Stay away from the bees. They might sting you.","離蜜蜂遠一點。牠們可能會螫你。"],["tame","馴服的；馴服","obedient a. 順從的；docile a. 溫馴的；wild a. 野生的","Strange to say, the wild horse became very tame as soon as it saw me.","說也奇怪，那匹野馬一看到我就變得非常溫馴。"],["thirst","口渴；渴望","quench one’s thirst 解渴；thirst for sth 渴望某物；long for sth 渴望某物；thirsty a. 口渴的","I need a glass of water to quench my thirst.","我需要一杯水來解渴。"],["tow","拖；牽引","tow sth away 拖走某物；give sb / sth a tow 拖／拉某人或某物","All illegally parked cars are to be towed away.","所有違規停放的車輛都將被拖走。"],["vase","花瓶","a vase of flowers 一瓶花","I bumped into a table and broke a vase.","我撞到桌子，打破了一個花瓶。"],["lollipop","棒棒糖","—","You should brush your teeth after eating the lollipop, Johnny.","強尼，吃完棒棒糖後你應該刷牙。"],["teenage","青少年的","teenaged a. 青少年的；teenager n. 青少年；teen(s) n. 青少年；adolescent n. 青少年","My teenage daughter loves rock ’n’ roll.","我十幾歲的女兒很喜歡搖滾樂。"],["tank","坦克；槽；箱","a water tank 水箱；a fuel tank 燃料箱；a gas tank 汽油箱；tanker n. 油輪／油罐車","The tank smashed through the building at a high speed.","那輛坦克高速撞穿了建築物。"],["bacteria","細菌（複數）","bacterium（單數）；germ n. 細菌；virus n. 病毒","Handrails are covered in / with bacteria.","扶手上布滿了細菌。"],["bay","海灣","keep sb at bay = keep sb at a distance 使某人保持距離；gulf n. 海灣；mansion n. 豪宅","Polly lives in a beautiful mansion overlooking the bay.","波莉住在一棟可俯瞰海灣的漂亮豪宅裡。"],["bomb","炸彈；轟炸","a bomb squad 拆彈小組；bomber n. 轟炸機／投彈者；bombard vt. 轟炸；mine n. 地雷；missile n. 飛彈","The time bomb went off at 10, killing all the people around.","定時炸彈在十點爆炸，炸死周遭所有的人。"],["cave","洞穴","a cave-in 塌方／洞穴坍塌","The cave was dark and scary.","那個洞穴又黑又可怕。"],["flute","長笛","play the flute 吹長笛","John plays the flute very well.","約翰長笛吹得很好。"],["razor","刮鬍刀；剃刀","a razor blade 刮鬍刀片；shaver n. 電動刮鬍刀；disposable a. 用完即丟的；disposable chopsticks 免洗筷","I bought some disposable razors for my trip overseas.","我買了一些免洗刮鬍刀，準備出國旅行時使用。"],["blade","刀片；葉片","razor blade 刮鬍刀片；dull a. 鈍的","The razor blade is dull, so you have to replace it with a new one.","這片刮鬍刀片鈍了，所以你得換一片新的。"],["magnet","磁鐵","magnetic a. 有磁性的；磁力的","The boy picked up the nails with a magnet.","那男孩用磁鐵把釘子吸起來。"]]};
function _makeBlankForImported(word,ex){
  if(!ex||ex==='沒有') return '';
  const esc=s=>s.replace(/[.*+?^$(){}|[\]\\]/g,'\\$&');
  let re=new RegExp('\\b'+esc(word)+'\\b','i');
  if(re.test(ex)) return ex.replace(re,'______');
  const base=word.toLowerCase().replace(/(ing|ed|es|s|y)$/,'');
  if(base.length>=4){re=new RegExp('\\b'+esc(base)+'[A-Za-z]*\\b','i'); if(re.test(ex)) return ex.replace(re,'______');}
  return '';
}
for(const [u,rows] of Object.entries(RAW_U09_U24)){
  D[u]=rows.map(([word,zh,usage,example,trans])=>[word,zh,_makeBlankForImported(word,example),trans,usage,usage]);
}
